RADAR_LOAD("2024-07",[{"id":"10.3390/nano14151289","t":"Sustainable Graphene Production: Flash Joule Heating Utilizing Pencil Graphite Precursors","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/nano14151289","s":"Nanomaterials","d":"2024-07-31","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The production of graphene from cost-effective and readily available sources remains a significant challenge in materials science. This study investigates the potential of common pencil leads as precursors for graphene synthesis using the Flash Joule Heating (FJH) process. We examined 6H, 4B, and 14B pencil grades, representing different graphite-to-clay ratios, under varying voltages (0 V, 200 V, and 400 V) to elucidate the relationships among initial composition, applied voltage, and resulting graphene quality. Samples were characterized using Raman spectroscopy, electrical resistance measurements, and microscopic analysis. The results revealed grade-specific responses to applied voltages, with all samples showing decreased electrical resistance post-FJH treatment. Raman spectroscopy indicated significant structural changes, particularly in ID/IG and I2D/IG ratios, providing insights i","au":["Mashhood Zahid","Tomy Abuzairi"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"可持续石墨烯生产：利用铅笔石墨前驱体的闪光焦耳热","zb":"本研究调查了普通铅笔芯作为前驱体，利用闪光焦耳热（FJH）过程合成石墨烯的潜力。考察了6H、4B和14B铅笔等级（代表不同的石墨-粘土比例），在0 V、200 V和400 V不同电压下，阐明了初始成分、施加电压和结果石墨烯质量之间的关系。通过拉曼光谱、电阻测量和微观分析表征了样品。结果表明，所有样品在FJH处理后电阻均降低。拉曼光谱表明结构发生显著变化，特别是在ID/IG和I2D/IG比率上，提供了关于缺陷密度和层堆叠的见解。值得注意的是，14B铅笔芯在400 V时表现出独特行为，ID/IG比率从0.135降至0.031，晶粒尺寸从143 nm增加到612 nm，表明可能存在原位退火效应。相比之下，较硬的等级（6H和4B）在较高电压下缺陷密度增加。这项研究有助于开发更高效和环保的石墨烯生产方法，可能为可持续和可扩展的合成开辟新的途径。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1002/chem.202401644","t":"Microwave‐Assisted Ultrafast Synthesis of Bimetallic Nickel‐Cobalt Metal‐Organic Frameworks for Application in the Oxygen Evolution Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/chem.202401644","s":"Chemistry – A European Journal","d":"2024-07-31","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Herein, a series of monometallic Ni‐, Co‐ and Zn‐MOFs and bimetallic NiCo‐, NiZn‐ and CoZn‐MOFs of formula M 2 (BDC) 2 DABCO and (M,M’) 2 (BDC) 2 DABCO, respectively, (M, M’=metal) with the same pillar and layer linkers 1,4‐diazabicyclo[2.2.2]octane (DABCO) and benzene‐1,4‐dicarboxylate (BDC) were prepared through a fast microwave‐assisted thermal conversion synthesis method (MW) within only 12 min. In the bimetallic MOFs the ratio M:M’ was 4 : 1. The mono‐ and bimetallic MOFs were selected to systematically explore the catalytic‐activity of their derived metal oxide/hydroxides for the oxygen evolution reaction (OER). Among all tested bimetallic MOF‐derived catalysts, the NiCoMOF exhibits superior catalytic activity for the OER with the lowest overpotentials of 301 mV and Tafel slopes of 42 mV dec −1 on a rotating disk glassy carbon electrode (RD‐GCE) in 1 mol L −1 KOH electroly","au":["Thi Hai Yen Beglau","Yanyan Fei","Christoph Janiak"],"o":"回填","why":["Ultrafast Synthesis"],"zt":"微波辅助超快合成双金属镍钴金属有机框架用于析氧反应","zb":"通过微波辅助热转化合成方法（MW）在仅12分钟内制备了一系列单金属Ni-、Co-和Zn-MOFs以及双金属NiCo-、NiZn-和CoZn-MOFs，化学式为M2(BDC)2DABCO和(M,M')2(BDC)2DABCO。双金属MOFs中M:M'比例为4:1。选择单金属和双金属MOFs系统研究了其衍生的金属氧化物/氢氧化物对析氧反应（OER）的催化活性。NiCoMOF对OER表现出优异的催化活性，在1 mol L−1 KOH电解质中，10 mA cm−2电流密度下过电位最低为301 mV，Tafel斜率为42 mV dec−1。此外，NiCoMOF在25分钟内通过MW合成原位生长在镍泡沫（NF）表面，质量负载为16.6 mg MOF/g NF，在50和300 mA cm−2电流密度下过电位分别为313和328 mV，具有优异的长期稳定性。Tafel斜率为27 mV dec−1，电化学阻抗","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/admi.202300990","t":"Nucleation Behavior of SnS 2 on Thiol Functionalized SAMs During Solution‐Based Atomic Layer Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/admi.202300990","s":"Advanced Materials Interfaces","d":"2024-07-31","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Solution‐based atomic layer deposition (sALD) is an emerging technique that transfers the principle of traditional atomic layer deposition (ALD) from the gas phase into a wet chemical environment. This new preparation technique has new and unique properties and requirements. A large number of new surfaces and reactants are available to produce active 2D materials. In this work a reproducible procedure to coat silicon wafers with a densely packed monolayer of (3‐Mercaptopropyl)trimethoxysilane (MPTMS) molecules is presented. These highly functionalized surfaces can be used to seed the nucleation of SnS 2 in a solution‐based ALD procedure. A coating routine for the production of SnS 2 is adapted from ALD to sALD and insight into the nucleation behavior of the reactands is given. X‐ray reflectometry (XRR) is used to resolve the nucleation process of SnS 2 on an MPTMS self assembled","au":["Klaus Götz","Annemarie Prihoda","Chen Shen","Martin Dierner","Johannes Dallmann","Saskia Prusch"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"硫醇功能化SAMs上SnS2在溶液基原子层沉积过程中的成核行为","zb":"采用溶液基原子层沉积（sALD）技术在（3-巯基丙基）三甲氧基硅烷（MPTMS）自组装单层（SAM）上沉积SnS2。通过X射线反射率（XRR）、 Grazing incidence wide-angle X-ray scattering (GIWAXS)、 atomic force microscopy (AFM)、 energy dispersive X-ray spectroscopy (EDX)和密度泛函理论（DFT）计算研究了SnS2在sALD前三个循环中的成核过程。发现SnS2首先形成封闭层，然后在硫醇功能化硅烷SAM上以岛状生长。后续涂层循环将继续岛状材料的横向和高度生长。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202403319","t":"Unraveling the Active Sites on Mesoporous CuFe 2 O 4 @N‐Carbon Catalysts with Abundant Oxygen Vacancies and M‐N‐C Content for Boosted Nitrogen Reduction Toward Electrosynthesis of Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202403319","s":"Small","d":"2024-07-31","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Transition metal centers dispersed over nitrogen‐doped carbon (M–NC) supports have been widely explored for electrocatalytic reactions; however, sparsely reported for electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (ENRR). Particularly, the single‐atom catalysts (SACs) have shown reasonable ammonia yield rate and faradaic efficiency (FE), but their complex synthesis and low durability for long‐term electrocatalysis runs restrict their use on a larger scale. Importantly, the catalytic active sites in metal nanostructured‐based M‐NC catalysts toward enhanced N 2 adsorption and activation are still not clear as they are highly challenging to reveal. A few studies have predicted that the surface oxygen vacancies (O vac ) favor an enhanced ENRR performance. Herein, a strategy using tailored M‐NC content and O vac in a single catalyst for enhanced ammonia electrosynthesis is devised. A me","au":["Aamir Y. Bhat","Aejaz Ul Bashir","Priya Jain","Mohsin A. Bhat","Pravin Popinand Ingole"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesis of Ammonia"],"ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202402779","t":"Incorporating Zinc Metal Sites in Aluminum‐Coordinated Porphyrin Metal‐Organic Frameworks for Enhanced Photocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202402779","s":"Small","d":"2024-07-31","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Rationally designing photocatalysts is crucial for the solar‐driven nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) due to the stable N≡N triple bond. Metal‐organic frameworks (MOFs) are considered promising candidates but suffer from insufficient active sites and inferior charge transport. Herein, it is demonstrated that incorporating 3 d metal ions, such as zinc (Zn) or iron (Fe) ions, into Al‐coordinated porphyrin MOFs (Al‐PMOFs) enables the enhanced ammonia yield of 88.7 and 65.0 µg g cat −1 h −1 , 2.5‐ and 1.8‐fold increase compared to the pristine Al‐PMOF (35.4 µg g cat −1 h −1 ), respectively. The origin of ammonia (NH 3 ) is verified via isotopic labeling experiments. Incorporating Zn or Fe into Al‐PMOF generates active sites in Al‐PMOF, that is, Zn‐N 4 or Fe‐N 4 sites, which not only facilitates the adsorption and activation of N 2 molecules but suppresses the charge recombination. P","au":["Rui Liu","Hao Wu","Hoi Ying Chung","Wahyu Prasetyo Utomo","Yuanmeng Tian","Jin Shang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"将锌金属位点结合到铝配位卟啉金属有机框架中以提高光催化氮还原为氨","zb":"将锌（Zn）或铁（Fe）离子等3d金属离子合理地结合到铝配位卟啉金属有机框架（Al-PMOFs）中，使氨的产率提高到88.7和65.0 µg g cat −1 h −1 ，比原始Al-PMOF（35.4 µg g cat −1 h −1 ）分别提高了2.5倍和1.8倍。通过同位素标记实验验证了氨（NH 3 ）的来源。将Zn或Fe结合到Al-PMOF中，在Al-PMOF中产生活性位点，即Zn-N 4 或Fe-N 4 位点，这不仅促进了N 2 分子的吸附和活化，还抑制了电荷复合。光物理和理论研究进一步揭示，插入3d金属离子后，最低未占分子轨道（LUMO）水平向上移动到更活泼的位置（Zn的偏移幅度大于Fe）。Al-PMOF(3d金属)中促进的氮活化、抑制的电荷复合和更负的LUMO水平，使其光催化活性高于原始Al-PMOF。这项工作为设计高效的光催化剂提供了有前景的策略。","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Fe/铁体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202402543","t":"Sustained Area‐Selectivity in Atomic Layer Deposition of Ir Films: Utilization of Dual Effects of O 3 in Deposition and Etching","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202402543","s":"Small","d":"2024-07-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Area‐selective deposition (ASD) based on self‐aligned technology has emerged as a promising solution for resolving misalignment issues during ultrafine patterning processes. Despite its potential, the problems of area‐selectivity losing beyond a certain thickness remain critical in ASD applications. This study reports a novel approach to sustain the area‐selectivity of Ir films as the thickness increases. Ir films are deposited on Al 2 O 3 as the growth area and SiO 2 as the non‐growth area using atomic‐layer‐deposition with tricarbonyl‐(1,2,3‐ η )‐1,2,3‐tri( tert ‐butyl)‐cyclopropenyl‐iridium and O 3 . O 3 exhibits a dual effect, facilitating both deposition and etching. In the steady‐state growth regime, O 3 solely contributes to deposition, whereas in the initial growth stages, longer exposure to O 3 etches the initially formed isolated Ir nuclei through the formation of vola","au":["Han Kim","Taeseok Kim","Hong Keun Chung","Jihoon Jeon","Sung‐Chul Kim","Sung Ok Won"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积 Ir 薄膜的持续区域选择性：利用 O3 在沉积和刻蚀中的双重作用","zb":"在 Al2O3 作为生长区域和 SiO2 作为非生长区域上使用三羰基(1,2,3-η)-1,2,3-三(特丁基)-环丙烯-铱和 O3 进行原子层沉积。O3 具有双重作用，促进沉积和刻蚀。在稳态生长阶段，O3 仅贡献于沉积，而在初始生长阶段，较长的 O3 接触时间通过形成挥发性 IrO3 刻蚀最初形成的孤立 Ir 核。重要的是，与生长区域(Al2O3)相比，非生长区域(SiO2)的初始刻蚀需要更长的 O3 接触时间。通过控制 O3 注入时间，即使超过 25 nm 厚度，区域选择性也能通过抑制非生长区域的成核来维持。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.202408897","t":"High‐Stability van Der Waals Structures of GeTe/Sb 2 Te 3 Superlattices for 100× Increased Durability Phase‐Change Memory (PCM) by Low‐Temperature Atomic Layer Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.202408897","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2024-07-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract The superlattices phase‐change memory (SL‐PCM), based on GeTe/Sb 2 Te 3 superlattices (SLs), garners considerable attention within the academic community owing to its exceptional electrical properties. While the exact mechanism remains a topic of ongoing debate, researchers widely acknowledge that the presence of van der Waals (vdW) gap structures within SLs plays a pivotal role. However, the formation of vertical nanoparticles (VNPs) from the random orientation of Sb 2 Te 3 and the substantial intermixing between GeTe and Sb 2 Te 3 due to high‐temperature fabrication processes leads to pronounced elemental intermixing during electrical operations, causing a loss of SLs properties. This investigation uses atomic layer deposition techniques, specifically Sb‐atomic seed layer and periodic quintuple layers stacking, to address issues from random orientation Sb 2 Te 3 grains and ano","au":["Rong‐Jiang Zhu","Rui‐Zhe Zhao","Ke Gao","Zhuo‐Ran Zhang","Qiang He","Hao Tong"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"低温原子层沉积制备高稳定性GeTe/Sb2Te3超晶格用于提高100倍的相变存储器耐用性","zb":"基于GeTe/Sb2Te3超晶格（SLs）的超晶格相变存储器（SL-PCM）因其优异的电学特性而受到学术界广泛关注。尽管确切机制仍是一个持续讨论的话题，研究人员普遍认为SLs中的范德华（vdW）间隙结构起着关键作用。然而，由于Sb2Te3的随机取向导致垂直纳米颗粒（VNPs）的形成，以及高温制造工艺过程中GeTe和Sb2Te3之间的大量混合，导致在电气操作过程中出现明显的元素混合，导致SLs特性丧失。本研究使用原子层沉积技术，特别是Sb-原子种子层和周期性五重层堆叠，来解决随机取向Sb2Te3颗粒和异常VNPs的问题。这种方法产生了具有高稳定性vdW间隙结构的Sb2Te3结晶薄膜。利用这些薄膜，在90°C的显著低温下成功制造了具有优先晶体学取向的SLs。优化的SLs表现出卓越的结构稳定性，并在电气操作过程中减轻了合金相的出现，使器件耐久性提高了100倍。这项工作推进了可靠SL-PCM理解和","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/acsenergylett.4c01438","t":"Enhancing Ammonia Production by Ag Incorporation in Li-Mediated Nitrogen Reduction Reactions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.4c01438","s":"ACS Energy Letters","d":"2024-07-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Conventional ammonia production relies on the Haber–Bosch process, which is an energy-intensive process and emits significant amounts of CO 2 . Recent advances in electrochemical Li-mediated nitrogen reduction reactions (Li-NRRs) provide sustainable pathways. While efforts have been made to develop electrolytes and devices, research on cathode materials for Li-NRRs is still limited. This study demonstrates that the introduction of Ag into the copper cathode system significantly contributes to the ammonia production activity of Li-NRRs, and improved performance is obtained especially for various Li salts containing fluorine in electrolytes. Small amounts of Ag salts enhance the selectivity toward ammonia, forming LiF and Ag–Li alloys in the solid electrolyte interphase. We demonstrate that lithiophilic Ag effectively mediates Li cycling, decreasing the overpotentials required for Li plati","au":["Yeongbae Jeon","Dongwoo Shin","Kijung Yong","Yun Jeong Hwang"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"通过Ag结合增强锂介导的氮还原反应中的氨生产","zb":"将Ag引入铜阴极系统，显著提高了锂介导的氮还原反应（Li-NRRs）的氨生产活性，特别是在电解质中含有氟的各种锂盐的情况下，性能得到改善。少量Ag盐提高了对氨的选择性，在固体电解质界面形成LiF和Ag–Li合金。研究表明，亲锂性的Ag有效介导Li循环，降低了Li-NRRs过程中锂沉积所需的过电位。这些见解为电极材料的发展提供了视角，并有可能利用未开发的金属作为Li-NRRs的电极。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/molecules29153611","t":"Stability of Nitrogen-Doped Activated Carbon as an Electrocatalyst for the Oxygen Reduction Reaction in Various Storage Media","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/molecules29153611","s":"Molecules","d":"2024-07-30","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Besides outstanding catalytic performance, the stability of nitrogen-doped carbon materials during storage is equally crucial for practical applications. Therefore, we conducted the first investigation into the stability of highly nitrogen-doped activated carbon (AC-NC-T) obtained by modifying activated carbon with CO2/NH3 in different storage media (air, vacuum and N2). The results of the catalysis of the oxygen reduction reaction and the activation of peroxymonosulfate for degrading bisphenol A by AC-NC-T show that the catalytic activity of AC-NC-T stored in air decays most prominently, while the performance attenuated only marginally when stored in vacuum and N2. The results from N2 adsorption isotherms, Raman spectroscopy, elemental and X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy indicate that the decline in catalytic activity is due to the presence of oxygen in the environment, causing a decre","au":["Tao Zhang","Songlin Zuo"],"o":"回填","zt":"氮掺杂活化碳作为氧还原反应电催化剂在各种储存介质中的稳定性","zb":"除了优异的催化性能外，氮掺杂碳材料在储存期间的稳定性对于实际应用同样至关重要。因此，我们首次研究了通过用CO2/NH3改性活性炭获得的具有高氮掺杂的活化碳（AC-NC-T）在不同储存介质（空气、真空和N2）中的稳定性。AC-NC-T催化氧还原反应和活化过一硫酸盐降解双酚A的结果表明，储存在空气中的AC-NC-T的催化活性衰减最为显著，而储存在真空和N2中的性能衰减仅轻微。N2吸附等温线、拉曼光谱、元素分析和X射线光电子能谱的结果表明，催化活性的下降是由于环境中存在氧气，导致吡啶氮（N-6）和石墨氮（N-Q）的绝对含量下降。在空气气氛中储存28天后，AC-NC-950中N-6和N-Q的绝对含量分别减少了19.3%和12.1%。然而，当储存在真空或N2中时，两者的减少都小于7%。这项研究表明，在储存期间降低氧浓度对于保持含氮碳材料的高催化活性至关重要。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1116/6.0003769","t":"First principles reaction processes of Co(CO)3NO as an atomic layer deposition precursor on SiO2 and Co surfaces","u":"https://doi.org/10.1116/6.0003769","s":"Journal of Vacuum Science & Technology A","d":"2024-07-29","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"As devices continue to scale down in size, new patterning and deposition techniques are growing in interest. Atomic layer deposition (ALD) has shown to have promising results in selective and low-temperature deposition processes with high conformality and atomic layer control. These properties have led to the increased dependence on ALD process for device fabrication. To further achieve low-temperature deposition, electron enhanced ALD (EE-ALD) has been introduced. EE-ALD is shown to be a viable option for depositing films at room temperature as a way to supplement the thermal energy otherwise needed to overcome activation energies in the deposition process. Furthermore, metals such as Co and Ru are shown to have promising results in replacing Cu lines while using smaller barriers and liners, thus increasing the effective cross section of the conducting interconnect. The reduction in the","au":["Nickolas M. Ashburn","Xiuyao Lang","Youhwan Jo","Yeonghun Lee","Xiaolong Yao","Kyeongjae Cho"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"Co(CO)3NO 在 SiO2 和 Co 表面上的原子层沉积前驱体的第一性原理反应过程","zb":"研究了使用前驱体 Co(CO)3NO 在 SiO2 和 Co 表面上进行原子层沉积的反应过程，以及如何使用电子增强原子层沉积 (EE-ALD) 降低沉积温度。研究了电子增强的作用，包括前驱体分子的可能电子激发和局部表面加热机制。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.4c03245","t":"Modulating the Surface Concentration and Lifetime of Active Hydrogen in Cu-Based Layered Double Hydroxides for Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.4c03245","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2024-07-29","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Strategies incorporating heterometals to introduce surface-active hydrogen (*H) have been extensively utilized to enhance the electrocatalytic activity of Cu-based catalysts in the nitrate reduction reaction (NitRR). However, a comprehensive understanding of *H behavior and its specific impact on regulating the NitRR pathway remains elusive, particularly in a quantitative manner. In this study, we prepared a group of layered double hydroxides (LDHs) as model catalysts with diverse *H concentrations and lifetimes. Our findings reveal that the NitRR activity of Cu-based LDHs is highly dependent on the *H species that could be modulated by the incorporated heterometallic sites. Specifically, we conducted in situ analysis of different Cu-based LDH catalysts using time-resolved scanning electrochemical microscopy. The surface concentration and lifetime of *H at various applied potentials were","au":["Hongmei Li","Shiping Li","Renjun Guan","Zhaoyu Jin","Dan Xiao","Yong Guo"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"调节Cu基层状双氢氧化物中活性氢的表面浓度和寿命以促进硝酸还原为氨的电催化","zb":"将异金属结合到Cu基催化剂中以引入表面活性氢（*H）的策略已被广泛用于提高硝酸还原反应（NitRR）中的电催化活性。然而，对*H行为及其对调节NitRR途径的特定影响仍缺乏全面的理解，尤其是在定量方面。在本研究中，我们制备了一系列具有不同*H浓度和寿命的层状双氢氧化物（LDHs）作为模型催化剂。我们的研究结果表明，Cu基LDHs的NitRR活性高度依赖于可被结合的异金属位点调节的*H物种。具体而言，我们使用时间分辨扫描电化学显微镜对不同Cu基LDH催化剂进行了原位分析。量化了不同电位下*H的表面浓度和寿命，从而建立了*H行为与NitRR性能之间的关系。因此，CuNi-LDHs表现出最佳的NitRR性能，其法拉第效率为94.6%，产率为2.7 mg h –1 cm –2 ，这是由于其适当的*H表面浓度和寿命。此外，我们观察到在氨生产方面法拉第效率的趋势为CuNi > CuCo > Cu > ","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsnano.4c03995","t":"Cascade Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction Reaching 100% Nitrate-N to Ammonia-N Conversion over Cu 2 O@CoO Yolk–Shell Nanocubes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsnano.4c03995","s":"ACS Nano","d":"2024-07-29","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electroreduction of nitrate to ammonia via a selective eight-electron transfer nitrate reduction reaction offers a promising, low energy consumption, pollution-free, green NH3 synthesis strategy alternative to the Haber-Bosch method. However, it remains a great challenge to achieve high NH4+ selectivity and complete conversion from NO3--N to NH4+-N. Herein, we report ingredients adjustable Cu2O@CoO yolk-shell nanocubes featured with tunable inner void spaces and diverse activity centers, favoring the rapid cascade conversion of NO3- into NO2- on Cu2O and NO2- into NH4+ on CoO. Cu2O@CoO yolk-shell nanocubes exhibit super NH4+ Faradaic efficiencies (>99%) over a wide potential window (-0.2 V to -0.9 V versus RHE) with a considerable NH4+ yield rate of 15.27 mg h-1 cm-2 and fantastic cycling stability and long-term chronoamperometric durability. Cu2O@CoO yolk-shell nanocubes exhibited g","au":["Wenjing Huang","Wenyu Luo","Jiawei Liu","Bei-Er Jia","Carmen Lee","Jinfeng Dong"],"o":"回填","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"在Cu 2 O@CoO核壳纳米立方体上实现高达100%硝酸盐氮到氨氮转化的级联电催化硝酸还原","zb":"通过选择性八电子转移硝酸还原反应将硝酸盐还原为氨，提供了一种有前景的低能耗、无污染、绿色的NH3合成策略，作为哈伯-博施方法的替代方案。然而，实现高NH4+选择性和从NO3--N到NH4+-N的完全转化仍然是一个巨大的挑战。在此，我们报道了成分可调的Cu2O@CoO核壳纳米立方体，具有可调的内空腔和多种活性中心，有利于在Cu2O上快速级联转化NO3-为NO2-，在CoO上转化NO2-为NH4+。Cu2O@CoO核壳纳米立方体在宽电位窗口（-0.2 V至-0.9 V相对于RHE）上表现出超NH4+法拉第效率（>99%），具有相当高的NH4+产率（15.27 mg h-1 cm-2 ）以及出色的循环稳定性和长期chronoamperometric耐久性。Cu2O@CoO核壳纳米立方体在稀释（500 ppm）和高浓度（0.1和1 M）NO3-电解质中均表现出优异的NO3--N到NH4+-N转化效","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1088/1361-6528/ad64da","t":"Covalent surface modification of single-layer graphene-like BC 6 N nanosheets with reactive nitrenes for selective ammonia sensing via DFT modeling","u":"https://doi.org/10.1088/1361-6528/ad64da","s":"Nanotechnology","d":"2024-07-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Novel graphene-like nanomaterials with a non-zero bandgap are important for the design of gas sensors. The selectivity toward specific targets can be tuned by introducing appropriate functional groups on their surfaces. In this study, we use first-principles simulations, in the form of density functional theory (DFT), to investigate the covalent functionalization of a single-layer graphitized BC 6 N with azides to yield aziridine-functionalized adducts and explore their possible use to realize ammonia sensors. First, we determine the most favorable sites for physical adsorption and chemical reaction of methylnitrene, arising from the decomposition of methylazide, onto a BC 6 N monolayer. Then, we examine the thermodynamics of the [1 + 2]–cycloaddition reaction of various phenylnitrenes and perfluorinated phenylnitrenes para-substituted with (R = CO 2 H, SO 3 H) groups, demonstra","au":["Sabrine Baachaoui","Rabiaa Hajlaoui","Sami Ben Aoun","Alessandro Fortunelli","Luca Sementa","Noureddine Raouafi"],"o":"回填","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及碳材料"},{"id":"10.1039/d4ta03098b","t":"Twin boundaries induced by high-temperature shock boost the structural stability of Li-rich layered-oxide","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d4ta03098b","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2024-07-29","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"A non-equilibrium high-temperature shock (HTS) strategy, accompanied with the processes of rapid heating and cooling, is reported to introduce twin boundaries (TBs) into Li 1.2 Ni 0.13 Co 0.13 Mn 0.54 O 2 .","au":["Zhedong Liu","Cuihua Zeng","Jingchao Zhang","Jiawei Luo","Zhaoxin Guo","Zekun Li"],"o":"回填","why":["high-temperature shock"],"zt":"高温冲击诱导的孪晶边界增强锂丰富层状氧化物结构稳定性","zb":"采用非平衡高温冲击（HTS）策略，通过快速加热和冷却过程，在 Li 1.2 Ni 0.13 Co 0.13 Mn 0.54 O 2 中引入孪晶边界（TBs），以增强其结构稳定性。"},{"id":"10.2514/6.2024-4312","t":"Enhanced Ammonia Synthesis in Dielectric Barrier Discharge Plasma via Calcium Hydride and Calcium Nitride Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.2514/6.2024-4312","s":"AIAA AVIATION FORUM AND ASCEND 2024","d":"2024-07-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This work looks at three catalysts, calcium hydride, calcium nitride, and lithium hydride to assess their effectiveness for ammonia generation inside a dielectric barrier discharge plasma region. Powdered forms of each catalyst are dispersed using quartz wool inside a reactor with pure nitrogen and hydrogen flow as the gas composition. Results are quantified using a gas chromatography unit and laser absorption techniques. Thermodynamic properties of the plasma in the form of rotational and vibrational temperatures are measured using optical emission spectroscopy to determine how a non-equilibrium plasma could affect each catalyst. Results showed that calcium hydride produced the most ammonia at around 100 micro mols per gram per minute and a positive correlation can be observed between production and vibrational temperature levels for calcium hydride and lithium hydride.","au":["Camden E. Carroll","Ranganathan V. Rajagopalan","Ciel C. Voy","Zhili Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过氢化钙和氮化钙催化剂增强介电屏障放电等离子体中的氨合成","zb":"研究三种催化剂：氢化钙、氮化钙和氢化锂，以评估它们在介电屏障放电等离子体区域中产生氨的效率。使用气相色谱单元和激光吸收技术量化结果，并通过光发射光谱测量等离子体的热力学性质，以确定非平衡等离子体如何影响每种催化剂。结果显示，氢化钙产生了最多的氨，约为每克每分钟 100 微摩尔，并且钙氢化物和氢化锂的产生量与振动温度水平呈正相关。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.3390/agronomy14081651","t":"Optimizing the Water and Nitrogen Management Scheme to Enhance Potato Yield and Water–Nitrogen Use Efficiency","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/agronomy14081651","s":"Agronomy","d":"2024-07-27","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Water and nitrogen are the primary constraints on improving agricultural productivity. The aims of this study are to investigate the synergistic effects of water and nitrogen, optimize their combination schemes under mulched drip irrigation systems in the northwest region of China, and offer scientific insight into enhancing water and nitrogen use efficiency in potato cultivation. The traditional cultivar “Qing Shu 10” was chosen for the test material. A two-year field study on potato water–nitrogen interaction was conducted in the central Hexi Corridor, within Ganzhou District of Zhangye City, with three irrigation levels (W1 (336 mm), W2 (408 mm), and W3 (480 mm)) and three nitrogen application rates (N1 (44 kg ha−1), N2 (192 kg ha−1), and N3 (240 kg ha−1)) using a fully randomized combination design, resulting in nine treatments. This study examined the varying responses in potato yie","au":["Zhiqiang Ju","Dongrong Li","Yanqiang Cui","Dongyuan Sun"],"o":"回填","zt":"优化水和氮管理方案以提高马铃薯产量和氮-水利用效率","zb":"研究水和氮的协同效应，优化在中国西北地区覆盖滴灌系统下的组合方案，以提供科学见解，提高马铃薯种植中的水和氮利用效率。选择传统品种“清薯10”进行测试。在中卫市甘州区中央河西走廊进行了为期两年的马铃薯水-氮相互作用田间研究，使用三种灌溉水平（W1 (336 mm), W2 (408 mm), 和 W3 (480 mm)）和三种氮施用量（N1 (44 kg ha−1), N2 (192 kg ha−1), 和 N3 (240 kg ha−1)），采用完全随机组合设计，共九个处理。研究考察了不同水-氮组合对马铃薯产量和氮-水利用效率在不同水-氮组合下的响应，开发了基于水-氮相互作用的数学回归模型来预测马铃薯的经济效益，并完善了应用策略。结果表明，灌溉水量和氮施用量均显著影响马铃薯产量和氮-水利用效率。灌溉水量和氮施用量之间存在明显的交互作用。减少灌溉水量限制了氮的吸收，当从 W1 到 W2 时，","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1093/nsr/nwae251","t":"Ru3@Mo2CO2 MXene single-cluster catalyst for highly efficient N2-to-NH3 conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1093/nsr/nwae251","s":"National Science Review","d":"2024-07-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"ABSTRACT Single-cluster catalysts (SCCs) representing structurally well-defined metal clusters anchored on support tend to exhibit tunable catalytic performance for complex redox reactions in heterogeneous catalysis. Here we report a theoretical study on an SCC of Ru3@Mo2CO2 MXene for N2-to-NH3 thermal conversion. Our results show that Ru3@Mo2CO2 can effectively activate N2 and promotes its conversion to NH3 through an association mechanism, in which the rate-determining step of NH2* + H* → NH3* has a low energy barrier of 1.29 eV. Notably, with the assistance of Mo2CO2 support, the positively charged Ru3 cluster active site can effectively adsorb and activate N2, leading to 0.74 |e| charge transfer from Ru3@Mo2CO2 to the adsorbed N2. The supported Ru3 also acts as an electron reservoir to regulate the charge transfer for various intermediate steps of ammonia synthesis. Microkinetic anal","au":["Cong Zhang","Ze-Hui Wang","Haiyan Wang","Jin-Xia Liang","Chun Zhu","Jun Li"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Ru3@Mo2CO2 MXene 单团簇催化剂高效固氮","zb":"理论计算表明 Ru3@Mo2CO2 MXene 单团簇通过关联机制高效活化 N2，在 48 bar 和 700 K 条件下，其 N2 到 NH3 的转换频率高达 1.45 × 10−2 s−1 site−1。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202470116","t":"High‐Throughput Ammonia Production from Nitrate Using Liquid Metal Synthesized Bismuth Nano‐Catalyst (Adv. Energy Mater. 28/2024)","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202470116","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2024-07-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Ammonia Production By precisely depositing materials at the microscale through 3D printing of catalysts and graphene liquid crystals, in article 2304287, Kourosh Kalantar-Zadeh, Ali (Rouhollah) Jalili, Dorna Esrafilzadeh, and co-workers create a high-performance electrochemical system for the efficient conversion of nitrate to ammonia. This process involves catalyst synthesis using liquid metals and the self-assembly of nano-ordered layered electrocatalysts, supporting sustainable ammonia production and contributing to global net-zero targets.","au":["Sahar Nazari","Jing Sun","Mahroo Baharfar","Philippe Poulin","Kourosh Kalantar‐Zadeh","Ali (Rouhollah) Jalili"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"使用液体金属合成的铋纳米催化剂从硝酸盐中高通量生产氨（Adv. Energy Mater. 28/2024）","zb":"通过 3D 打印催化剂和石墨烯液晶，在微尺度上精确沉积材料，创建了一种高效的电化学系统，用于将硝酸盐转化为氨。该过程涉及使用液体金属合成催化剂和纳米有序层状电催化剂的自组装，支持可持续的氨生产，并为全球净零目标做出贡献。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1109/icocn63276.2024.10648438","t":"Cadmium Sulfide Coated Micro-Nano Fiber Optic Sensor for Ammonia Gas Sensing","u":"https://doi.org/10.1109/icocn63276.2024.10648438","s":"2024 22nd International Conference on Optical Communications and Networks (ICOCN)","d":"2024-07-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Cadmium sulfide coated micro-nano fiber optic sensor has been developed for measuring trace amounts of ammonia gas. Cadmium sulfide is obtained by chemical precipitation method and is dripped onto the surface of the tapered fiber. When the sensor is placed in an environment containing ammonia, ammonia molecules will bind with cadmium sulfide, thereby changing the relative refractive index of the surface of the tapered fiber and causing a redshift in the interference spectrum. The experimental results show that the ammonia sensitivity of the sensor is 10.88pm/ppm. Additionally, the sensor has good selectivity.","au":["Yutong Sun","Yong Zhao","Yanan Zhang"],"o":"回填","zt":"镉硫化物涂层微-纳米光纤传感器用于氨气传感","zb":"开发了一种镉硫化物涂层微-纳米光纤传感器，用于测量痕量氨气。通过化学沉淀法制备镉硫化物，并将其滴加到锥形光纤表面。当传感器置于含有氨的环境中时，氨分子会与镉硫化物结合，从而改变锥形光纤表面的相对折射率，并导致干涉光谱的红色偏移。实验结果表明，该传感器的氨灵敏度是 10.88pm/ppm。此外，该传感器具有良好的选择性。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpcc.4c01112","t":"Density Functional Theory Investigation into Modulating Surface–Adsorbate Interactions with Strain for Ammonia Synthesis on a Pd (111) Surface","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpcc.4c01112","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry C","d":"2024-07-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"High Resolution Image Download MS PowerPoint Slide Strain has been shown to modulate adsorption and reactions on metal surfaces. While its effect on surface–adsorbate interactions has been rationalized, an understanding of the electronic factors that drive these interactions and their consequences on catalytic activity is lacking. In this work, we used an ab initio density functional theory (DFT) to develop descriptors to describe the effect of biaxial strain in modulating interactions of adsorbates and transition states (TS) with the Pd (111) surface and its effect on the catalytic activity for ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis. We established the p-band center (p center ) of the NH X (x = 0,1,2,3) and N 2 adsorbates and hydrogenation TSs, and the hybridized d-band center (d center ) of the surface metal as key electronic descriptors for adsorbate and TS energy variations with strain. The p cen","au":["Siddhesh S. Borkar","Manish Shetty"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"应变调控 Pd (111) 表面吸附物相互作用","zb":"利用密度泛函理论建立描述符，发现拉伸应变通过增强N2解离和原子N吸附来促进氨合成，在±2%的净拉伸应变下，N2解离增强约5倍，总反应转换频率增强约10倍。"},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-024-50531-6","t":"Enabling high throughput deep reinforcement learning with first principles to investigate catalytic reaction mechanisms","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-024-50531-6","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2024-07-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Exploring catalytic reaction mechanisms is crucial for understanding chemical processes, optimizing reaction conditions, and developing more effective catalysts. We present a reaction-agnostic framework based on high-throughput deep reinforcement learning with first principles (HDRL-FP) that offers excellent generalizability for investigating catalytic reactions. HDRL-FP introduces a generalizable reinforcement learning representation of catalytic reactions constructed solely from atomic positions, which are subsequently mapped to first-principles-derived potential energy landscapes. By leveraging thousands of simultaneous simulations on a single GPU, HDRL-FP enables rapid convergence to the optimal reaction path at a low cost. Its effectiveness is demonstrated through the studies of hydrogen and nitrogen migration in Haber-Bosch ammonia synthesis on the Fe(111) surface. Our fin","au":["Tian Lan","Huan Wang","Qi An"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于第一性原理的高通量深度强化学习研究催化反应机理","zb":"提出一种基于高通量深度强化学习与第一性原理（HDRL-FP）的反应无关框架，利用原子位置构建通用强化学习表征并映射到势能面。该方法在单GPU上通过数千次模拟快速收敛至最优反应路径，成本较低。在Fe(111)表面合成氨研究中，发现Langmuir-Hinshelwood机制与Eley-Rideal机制在H迁移至NH2过程中具有相同过渡态，且反应路径能量垒低于 nudged elastic band 计算。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","top":1},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-024-50670-w","t":"Gradient-concentration RuCo electrocatalyst for efficient and stable electroreduction of nitrate into ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-024-50670-w","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2024-07-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia holds great promise for developing green technologies for electrochemical ammonia energy conversion and storage. Considering that real nitrate resources often exhibit low concentrations, it is challenging to achieve high activity in low-concentration nitrate solutions due to the competing reaction of the hydrogen evolution reaction, let alone considering the catalyst lifetime. Herein, we present a high nitrate reduction performance electrocatalyst based on a Co nanosheet structure with a gradient dispersion of Ru, which yields a high NH3 Faraday efficiency of over 93% at an industrially relevant NH3 current density of 1.0 A/cm2 in 2000 ppm NO3- electrolyte, while maintaining good stability for 720 h under −300 mA/cm2. The electrocatalyst maintains high activity even in 62 ppm NO3- electrolyte. Electrochemical studies, density functional theor","au":["Xinhong Chen","Yumeng Cheng","Bo Zhang","Jia Zhou","Sisi He"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"梯度浓度 RuCo 电催化剂用于高效稳定的硝酸电还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为硝酸电还原为氨的电催化剂，采用 Co 纳米片结构梯度分散 Ru 制备电催化剂，在 2000 ppm NO3- 电解液中，NH3 法拉第效率超过 93%，在 -300 mA/cm2 下稳定 720 小时，甚至在 62 ppm NO3- 电解液中保持高活性。通过电化学研究、密度泛函理论、电化学原位拉曼光谱和傅里叶变换红外光谱证实，梯度浓度设计降低了反应能垒，提高了活性并抑制了 Co 晶格膨胀引起的催化剂演变，增强了稳定性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1088/1361-6463/ad5f3d","t":"Nanosecond pulsed gliding arc plasma for ammonia synthesis: better insight from discharge mode and vibrational temperature","u":"https://doi.org/10.1088/1361-6463/ad5f3d","s":"Journal of Physics D: Applied Physics","d":"2024-07-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Low-temperature plasma technology is a promising technological route to achieve green and efficient ammonia synthesis at ambient temperature and pressure. In this work, a Laval nozzle type gliding arc plasma reactor was designed for the direct synthesis of ammonia from N 2 and H 2 discharges ignited by a high voltage nanosecond pulsed power supply to investigate the effect of different electrode gaps, pulse voltages, and V N2 : V H2 on ammonia synthesis. The nanosecond pulsed plasma discharges were characterized through oscilloscope and optical emission spectroscopy (OES). The maximum rate of NH 3 synthesis was 538.12 μ mol·h −1 at 1.5 mm electrode gap, 16 kV peak pulse voltage, 6 kHz pulse repetition frequency, 100 ns pulse width, 100 ns pulse rising edge, 100 ns pulse falling edge, and 200 mL·min −1 total gas flow rate with V N2 : V H2 = 1:1. It was demonstrated that the disch","au":["Xiaofang Xu","Meng Sun","Qinlong Song","Guangyi Liu","Haibao Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202402294","t":"A Bio-inspired Dendritic MoOx Electrocatalyst for Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202402294","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2024-07-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Drawing inspiration from the nitrate reductase enzymes, which catalyze nitrate to nitrite in nature, here a bio‐inspired, reduced molybdenum oxide (MoO x ) shell is introduced that is grown on top of a dendritic nickel foam core (Ni NF ). The resulting MoO x /Ni NF material is prepared via a facile, two‐step electrodeposition strategy using commercially available, low‐cost precursors. This catalytic material displays a remarkable faradaic efficiency (FE) of 99% at −0.5 V versus RHE and a high ammonia (NH 3 ) yield rate of up to 4.29 mmol h −1 cm −2 at −1.0 V versus RHE in neutral media. Most importantly, MoO x /Ni NF exhibits exceptional stability for the nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR), maintaining operation for over 3100 h at a high current density of −650 mA cm −2 , with a yield rate of 2.6 mmol h −1 cm −2 and a stable average NH 3 FE of ≈83%. Through combined XPS and in","au":["Yuan‐Zi Xu","Daniel F. Abbott","Robin N. Dürr","Tran Ngoc Huan","Victor Mougel"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"受生物启发的树枝状 MoOx 电催化剂用于高效电化学硝酸还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为硝酸还原为氨的电催化剂，采用两步电沉积策略制备 MoOx/Ni NF 材料，在 -0.5 V vs RHE 下 NH3 法拉第效率为 99%，在 -1.0 V vs RHE 下 NH3 产率高达 4.29 mmol h−1 cm−2。MoOx/Ni NF 在 -650 mA cm−2 高电流密度下稳定运行超过 3100 小时，产率为 2.6 mmol h−1 cm−2，平均 NH3 法拉第效率约为 83%。XPS 和原位拉曼光谱表明，MoOx/Ni NF 对硝酸盐的强亲和力与其材料中氧空位的显著存在有关。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pp":"ChemRxiv","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsnano.4c05568","t":"Entropy-Engineered Middle-In Synthesis of Dual Single-Atom Compounds for Nitrate Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsnano.4c05568","s":"ACS Nano","d":"2024-07-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Despite the immense potential of Dual Single-Atom Compounds (DSACs), the challenges in their synthesis process, including complexity, stability, purity, and scalability, remain primary concerns in current research. Here, we present a general strategy, termed \"Entropy-Engineered Middle-In Synthesis of Dual Single-Atom Compounds\" (EEMIS-DSAC), which is meticulously crafted to produce a diverse range of DSACs, effectively addressing the aforementioned issues. Our strategy integrates the advantages of both bottom-up and top-down paradigms, proposing an insight into optimizing the catalyst structure. The as-fabricated DSACs exhibited excellent activity and stability in the nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR). In a significant advancement, our prototypical CuNi DSACs demonstrated outstanding performance under conditions reminiscent of industrial wastewater. Specifically, under a NO3- concentrat","au":["Yao Hu","Haihui Lan","Junjun He","Wenjing Fang","Wen-Da Zhang","Shuanglong Lu"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"熵工程中位内合成双单原子化合物用于硝酸还原反应","zb":"研究对象为双单原子化合物 (DSACs) 用于硝酸还原反应 (NO3RR)，提出“熵工程中位内合成双单原子化合物 (EEMIS-DSAC)”策略，有效解决合成过程中的复杂性、稳定性、纯度和可扩展性挑战。制备的 DSACs 在 NO3RR 中表现出优异的活性和稳定性。原型 CuNi DSACs 在模拟工业废水的条件下表现出色，在 2000 ppm NO3- 浓度下，NH3 法拉第效率 (FE) 为 96.97%，质量生产力为 131.47 mg h−1 mg−1，面积生产力为 10.06 mg h−1 cm−2。即使在 0.5 M 高 NO3- 浓度下，NH3 FE 仍达到 90.61%，质量生产力为 1024.50 mg h−1 mg−1，面积生产力为 78.41 mg h−1 cm−2。"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202403399","t":"Boron‐Doped Ti 3 C 2 T x MXene for Effective and Durable High‐Current‐Density Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202403399","s":"Small","d":"2024-07-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis via the nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) offers a competitive strategy for nitrogen cycling and carbon neutrality; however, this is hindered by the poor NO 3 RR performance under high current density. Herein, it is shown that boron‐doped Ti 3 C 2 T x MXene nanosheets can highly efficiently catalyze the conversion of NO 3 RR‐to‐NH 3 at ambient conditions, showing a maximal NH 3 Faradic efficiency of 91% with a peak yield rate of 26.2 mgh −1 mg cat. −1 , and robust durability over ten consecutive cycles, all of them are comparable to the best‐reported results and exceed those of pristine Ti 3 C 2 T x MXene. More importantly, when tested in a flow cell, the designed catalyst delivers a current density of ‒1000 mA cm −2 at a low potential of ‒1.18 V versus the reversible hydrogen electrode and maintains a high NH 3 selectivity over a wide current densit","au":["Xia Luo","Yeyu Wu","Huihui Hu","Tianran Wei","Baoshan Wu","Junyang Ding"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"硼掺杂 Ti3C2Tx MXene 用于有效和耐用的 高电流密度 氨合成","zb":"研究对象为硝酸还原为氨的电催化剂，采用硼掺杂 Ti3C2Tx MXene 纳米片制备催化剂，在环境条件下高效催化 NO3RR-to-NH3 转换，最大 NH3 法拉第效率为 91%，峰值产率为 26.2 mgh−1 mg cat−1，连续十次循环后仍保持稳健耐用性。在流动池中测试时，催化剂在 -1.18 V vs RHE 低电位下提供 -1000 mA cm−2 电流密度，并在宽电流密度范围内保持高 NH3 选择性。理论模拟进一步表明，硼掺杂可以优化 NO3RR 中间体的吸附和活化，降低决定步骤能垒，从而提高 NH3 选择性。"},{"id":"10.1002/chem.202401675","t":"Design of Single‐Atom Catalysts on C 5 N 2 for Nitrogen Fixation at Ambient Conditions: A First‐Principles Study","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/chem.202401675","s":"Chemistry – A European Journal","d":"2024-07-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Single atom catalysts (SACs) exhibit the flexible coordination structure of the active site and high utilization of active atoms, making them promising candidates for nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) under ambient conditions. By the aid of first‐principles calculations based on DFT, we have systematically explored the NRR catalytic behavior of thirteen 4d‐ and 5d‐transition metal atoms anchored on 2D porous graphite carbon nitride C N . With high selectivity and outstanding activity, Zr, Nb, Mo, Ta, W and Re‐doped C N are identified as potential nominees for NRR. Particularly, Mo@C N possesses an impressive low limiting potential of −0.39 V (corresponding to a very low temperature and atmospheric pressure), featuring the potential determining step involving *N−N transitions to *N−NH via the distal path. The catalytic performance of TM@C N can be well characterized by the adsorp","au":["Liying Pan","Xuxin Kang","Shan Gao","Xiangmei Duan"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrogen Fixation"],"zt":"在 C5N2 上设计的单原子催化剂用于环境条件下的氮固定：第一性原理研究","zb":"研究对象为单原子催化剂 (SACs) 用于氮还原反应 (NRR)，通过基于 DFT 的第一性原理计算系统研究 4d- 和 5d- 过渡金属原子锚定在二维多孔石墨碳氮化物 C N 上的 NRR 催化行为。Zr、Nb、Mo、Ta、W 和 Re 掺杂的 C N 被确定为 NRR 的潜在候选者。特别是 Mo@C N 具有低极限电位 -0.39 V（对应极低温度和大气压力），其决定步骤涉及 *N−N 转变到 *N−NH 的远程路径。TM@C N 的催化性能可通过中间体 *N H 的吸附强度很好地表征。此外，催化性能 U 与结构描述符 之间存在火山关系，验证了 的鲁棒性和普适性。","ob":"涉及碳材料"},{"id":"10.3390/nano14151238","t":"Optimized Ammonia-Sensing Electrode with CeO2/rGO Nano-Composite Coating Synthesized by Focused Laser Ablation in Liquid","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/nano14151238","s":"Nanomaterials","d":"2024-07-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This study investigated the synthesis of cerium oxide (CeO2) nanoparticles (NPs) and composites with reduced graphene oxide (rGO) for the enhanced electrochemical sensing of ammonia. CeO2 NPs were prepared by the focused laser ablation in liquid (LAL) method, which enabled the production of high-purity, spherical nanoparticles with a uniform dispersion and sizes under 50 nm in a short time. The effects of varying irradiation fluence and time on the nanoparticle size, production yield, and dispersion were systematically studied. The synthesized CeO2 NPs were doped with rGO to form CeO2/rGO composites, which were drop casted to modify the glassy carbon electrodes (GCE). The CeO2/rGO-GCE electrodes exhibited superior electrochemical properties compared with single-component electrodes, which demonstrated the significant potential for ammonia detection, especially at a 4 J/cm2 fluence. The C","au":["Mengqi Shi","Hiroyuki Wada"],"o":"回填","zt":"通过聚焦激光液相制备的CeO2/rGO纳米复合涂层优化氨传感电极","zb":"研究对象为CeO2纳米颗粒和还原石墨烯氧化物(rGO)的合成，用于增强氨的电化学传感。采用聚焦激光液相法(LAL)制备CeO2纳米颗粒，实现了高纯度、球形、尺寸小于50nm的纳米颗粒的快速制备。研究了不同辐照通量和时间对纳米颗粒尺寸、产率和分散性的影响。将合成的CeO2纳米颗粒掺杂rGO形成CeO2/rGO复合材料，并滴涂在玻璃碳电极(GCE)上。CeO2/rGO-GCE电极与单一组分电极相比表现出优异的电化学性能，尤其在4 J/cm2通量下具有显著的氨检测潜力。SEM、EDS mapping和XRD分析证实CeO2纳米颗粒在rGO片层间均匀分散，增强了导电性。循环伏安法数据表明CeO2/rGO复合电极具有优异的电化学活性，其中2rGO/1CeO2比例表现出最高的电流响应和灵敏度。对不同氨浓度的CV响应呈线性关系，表明电极具有精确定量的能力。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及碳材料"},{"id":"10.21203/rs.3.rs-4394450/v1","t":"Chemical looping synthesis of amines from N2 via iron nitride as a mediator","u":"https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-4394450/v1","s":"Research Square","d":"2024-07-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Amines are commonly synthesized through the amination of organooxygenates using ammonia, frequently involving the use of noble metal catalysts. In this study, we present an alternative route to make amines using iron nitride (Fe 2.5 N) as the nitrogen source. Without any additional catalyst, Fe 2.5 N reacts with a range of alcohols at 250 °C under 1 or 10 bar H 2 to produce amines as major products. Mechanistic investigations indicate that hydrogen activates the nitrogen species within iron nitride, converting them into surface NH and NH 2 groups that then react with alcohols to form amines. Building on this foundation, we further demonstrated an iron nitride-mediated chemical looping pathway that utilizes N 2 as the nitrogen source to synthesize octylamines. In this process, N 2 first reacts with iron to form Fe x N by a ball-milling method at ambient temperature and 6 bar N 2 ","au":["Ning Yan","Haoyue Li","Tie Wang","Shifu Wang","Xuning Li","Yanqiang Huang"],"o":"回填","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨；涉及Fe/铁体系","pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/cphc.202300961","t":"Effect of External Electric Field on Nitrogen Activation on a Trimetal Cluster","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cphc.202300961","s":"ChemPhysChem","d":"2024-07-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Efficient nitrogen (N 2 ) fixation and activation under mild conditions are crucial for modern society. External electric fields ( F electric ) can significantly affect N 2 activation. In this work, the effect of F electric on N 2 activation by Nb 3 clusters supported in a sumanene bowl was studied by density functional theory calculations. Four typical systems at different stages of N−N activation were studied, including two intermediates and two transition states. The impact of F electric on various properties related to N 2 activation was investigated, including the N−N bond length, overlap population density of states (OPDOS), total energy of the system, adsorption energy of N 2 , decomposition of energy changes, and electron transfer. The sumanene not only functions as a support and protective substrate, but also serves as a donor or acceptor under different F electric cond","au":["Song‐Yang Zhang","Xun‐Lei Ding","Sheng‐Ze Qu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"外部电场对三金属簇上氮活化效应","zb":"研究对象为Nb3簇在sumanene碗载体上的氮活化，采用密度泛函理论计算研究外部电场对氮活化的影响。研究了四个不同阶段的N-N活化体系，包括两个中间体和两个过渡态。探讨了电场对N-N键长、态密度重叠布居、系统总能量、N2吸附能、能量变化分解和电子转移的影响。结果表明，负电场有利于N-N键活化，因为它促进电子转移至N-N区域，并改善金属与N2在活化过程中的d-π*轨道杂化。正电场仅在N-N接近解离时才改善d-π*轨道杂化。","ob":"电场辅助，未证实焦耳供热"},{"id":"10.1039/d4ra04517c","t":"Elucidating the role of potassium addition on the surface chemistry and catalytic properties of cobalt catalysts for ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d4ra04517c","s":"RSC Advances","d":"2024-07-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"The ammonia synthesis process produces millions of tons of ammonia annually needed for the production of fertilisers, making it the second most produced chemical worldwide. Although this process has been optimised extensively, it still consumes large amounts of energy (around 2% of global energy consumption), making it essential to improve its efficiency. To accelerate this improvement, research on catalysts is necessary. Here, we studied the role of potassium in ammonia synthesis on cobalt catalysts and found that it was detrimental to the catalytic activity. It was shown that, regardless of the amount of introduced K, the activity of the K-modified catalysts was much lower than that of the undoped catalyst. K was found to be in the form of oxide; however, it was unstable and reducible to metallic K, which easily volatilised from the catalyst surface under activation conditions. In addi","au":["Hubert Ronduda","Magdalena Zybert","Wojciech Patkowski","Andrzej Ostrowski","Kamil Sobczak","Dariusz Moszyński"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"钾添加对钴催化剂表面化学与催化性能的影响","zb":"研究发现钾添加剂会降低钴催化剂的活性，导致催化剂烧结、表面碱性降低及活性位点损失。"},{"id":"10.1021/acsaem.4c01131","t":"Advancing the Understanding of Photocatalytic Nitrate Reduction for Ammonia Synthesis: Copper Catalysts and Formic Acid Synergy","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaem.4c01131","s":"ACS Applied Energy Materials","d":"2024-07-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"In recent years, photo- and electrocatalytic nitrate reductions have emerged as promising methods for sustainable ammonia production. Among the catalysts studied, copper-based systems have shown superior efficiency and selectivity in nitrate conversion, especially in the presence of sacrificial formic acid. However, the catalytic activity of copper is often hindered by its unstable oxidation state, primarily due to surface oxidation, and the underlying reaction mechanism remains poorly understood. This study reports that the scavenger formic acid plays a versatile role in the CuO x:TiO 2 catalytic system: first, it stabilizes the Cu 2 O phase on the TiO 2 surface. Second, it acts as a hole scavenger, reducing electron–hole recombination. Third, as formic acid undergoes oxidation, it produces CO 2 •– radicals with significant reduction potential. These radicals effectively facilitate the ","au":["Ajith P. Varghese","Rugma T. P.","Bernaurdshaw Neppolian","Abdullah Saad AlArifi","Sandeep Kumar Lakhera"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"推进光催化硝酸盐还原合成氨的理解：铜催化剂和甲酸协同作用","zb":"研究对象为铜催化剂和甲酸协同作用下的光催化硝酸盐还原合成氨。研究发现甲酸在CuOx:TiO2催化体系中具有多功能作用：首先，稳定TiO2表面的Cu2O相；其次，作为空穴清除剂，减少电子-空穴复合；第三，甲酸氧化产生具有显著还原潜力的CO2•-自由基，有效促进硝酸盐离子的还原，生成氨。此外，铜独特的降解甲酸能力在其表面产生结合的原子氢，促进选择性硝酸盐加氢和后续氨的形成。CuOx:TiO2催化剂生成1.639 mmol/g/h氨，硝酸盐至氨的转化率为82%。","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.4c04572","t":"Efficient Synthesis of Co-Based Electrocatalysts from Waste Batteries and Distillers’ Grains toward Nitrate Wastewater to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.4c04572","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2024-07-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO 3 RR) for ammonia (NH 3 ) production is a novel method for ammonia synthesis, but many electrocatalysts have been synthesized from expensive chemicals and catalytic performance is still difficult to guarantee. Based on these key points, we creatively combined distiller grains with waste batteries to create Co-based catalytic materials that can be used for the NO 3 RR. At −1.4 V vs Hg/HgO, the NH 3 selectivity and Faraday efficiency were 91% and 86%, respectively. Moreover, at −1.5 V vs Hg/HgO, the maximum NH 3 generation of 58.97 mg h –1 mg cat. –1 and the maximum NO 3 – –N removal of 86% were attained. In situ attenuated total reflection surface-enhanced infrared absorption spectra and online differential electrochemical mass spectrometry revealed that the *NOH pathway was the primary pathway for the nitrate reduction reaction. Density function","au":["Zhenlin Mo","Xianxian He","Shaoqi Zhou","Baojun Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"从废旧电池和酒糟中高效合成钴基电催化剂用于硝酸盐废水到氨的转化","zb":"研究对象为利用废旧电池和酒糟合成钴基催化材料，用于硝酸盐还原反应(NO3RR)。在-1.4 V vs Hg/HgO下，氨选择性和法拉第效率分别为91%和86%。在-1.5 V vs Hg/HgO下，最大氨生成量为58.97 mg h-1 mg cat-1，最大硝酸盐-N去除率为86%。原位衰减全反射表面增强红外吸收光谱和在线差分电化学质量光谱揭示硝酸盐还原反应的主要路径为*NOH路径。密度泛函理论(DFT)计算表明，钴位点不仅阻止了H-H偶联步骤生成H2，还促进了NO3RR中*NO还原为*NHO的电位确定步骤(PDS)。更重要的是，与商业氨合成相比，最大成本降低约0.23元/千克，氨生产能耗低至10.75 KW h kg-1。通过利用废旧电池和酒糟，实现了高效废物利用，并达到了硝酸盐高效转化为氨的目标。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.4c03049","t":"Electroreduction from Nitrite to Ammonia over Cobalt Sulfide Nanorods on Nickel","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.4c03049","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2024-07-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrite reduction reaction (NO 2 RR) can meet the need to remove nitrite (NO 2 – ) pollutants and provide a sustainable way to produce ammonia (NH 3 ). However, the conversion process from NO 2 – to NH 3 is a complex multistep process involving six-electron transfer, posing a significant challenge for designing efficient catalysts for the NO 2 RR. Here, a series of cobalt-based sulfide (Co x S y ) nanorods (NRs) anchored on nickel foam (NF) with varying sulfur contents (CoS 1.035 NRs/NF, CoS 2 NRs/NF, Co 3 S 4 NRs/NF, and CoS 1.097 NRs/NF) were synthesized through phase-controlled synthesis. The optimal cobalt-based sulfide nanorods (CoS 2 NRs/NF) exhibit superior performance in the NO 2 RR, with an extremely high NO 2 – conversion rate (97.8%), Faradaic efficiency (97.9%), and NH 3 selectivity (98.7%). These results surpass those of previously reported NO 2 RR catalysts.","au":["Qingyue Li","Yudong Li","Dan Liu","Hanwen Cai","Enshan Han","Yanzhen He"],"o":"回填","why":["produce ammonia"],"zt":"在镍上钴硫化物纳米棒上的亚硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为钴硫化物(Co x S y )纳米棒锚定在镍泡沫(NF)上的亚硝酸盐还原反应(NO2RR)。通过相控合成制备了不同硫含量的CoS1.035 NRs/NF、CoS2 NRs/NF、Co3S4 NRs/NF和CoS1.097 NRs/NF。最优的钴硫化物纳米棒(CoS2 NRs/NF)在NO2RR中表现出优异性能，NO2-转化率(97.8%)、法拉第效率(97.9%)和氨选择性(98.7%)均超过先前报道的NO2RR催化剂。控制实验表明，对于不同的钴硫化物相，硫含量越高，产生的氢越多，越有利于NO2-到NH3的电还原。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.4c02430","t":"Engineering Reaction Pathway to Harmonize the Competition between NRR and HER for Efficient Photocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.4c02430","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2024-07-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Engineering a reaction pathway to harmonize the competition between nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) and hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) is an active strategy toward efficient ammonia synthesis. Herein, we insert a “hydrogen state switching” reaction between the NRR and HER in ammonia synthesis. H 2 from HER in NH 2 -MIL125 core is captured by the Ni nanoparticles on polydopamine shell and switched into adsorbed-state *H species, which are then transferred back to NH 2 -MIL125 core via NiO to react with nitrogen and produce NH 3 . By manipulating the reaction pathway of hydrogen generation-state switching-transfer-utilization, HER can supply the required hydrogen for NRR. Accordingly, our photocatalyst achieved the NH 3 yield and selectivity of 817 μmol g –1 h –1 and 99.8% in NRR, respectively, superior to those of most state-of-the-art photocatalysts. Our strategy, as “transforming-c","au":["Zhanfeng Zhao","Yao Nian","Jiafu Shi","Xin Xin","Xinyuan Huang","Yonghui Shi"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过构建反应路径协调氮还原反应与析氢反应竞争以实现高效光催化氨合成","zb":"研究对象为光催化氨合成体系，通过在氮还原反应与析氢反应之间引入“氢状态转换”反应，将析氢反应产生的 H2 从 NH2-MIL125 核心捕获并由 Ni 纳米颗粒在聚多巴胺壳上转换为吸附态 *H 物种，再通过 NiO 将 *H 物种转移回 NH2-MIL125 核心与氮反应生成 NH3。该方法使光催化剂在氮还原反应中实现了 817 μmol g–1 h–1 的 NH3 产率和 99.8% 的选择性，优于大多数现有光催化剂。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.4c01528","t":"Modifying the Substrate-Dependent Pd/Fe 2 O 3 Catalyst–Support Synergism with ZnO Atomic Layer Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.4c01528","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2024-07-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Low-loading Pd supported on Fe2O3 nanoparticles was synthesized. A common nanocatalyst system with previously reported synergistic enhancement of reactivity that is attributed to the electronic interactions between Pd and the Fe2O3 support. Fe2O3-selective precoalescence overcoating with ZnO atomic layer deposition (ALD), using Zn(CH2CH3)2 and H2O as precursors, dampens competitive hydrogenation reactivity at Fe2O3-based sites. The result is enhanced efficiency at the low-loading but high reactivity Pd sites. While this increases catalyst efficiency toward most aqueous redox reactions tested, it suppresses reactivity toward polyaromatic core substrates. X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) and ultraviolet photoelectron spectroscopy (UPS) show minimal electronic impacts for the ZnO overcoat on the Pd particles, implying a predominantly physical site blocking effect as the reason for the","au":["Lorianne R. Shultz-Johnson","Azina Rahmani","Johannes Frisch","Tzung-En Hsieh","Lin Hu","Jaynlynn Sosa"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"通过 ZnO 原子层沉积修改 Pd/Fe2O3 催化剂-载体协同作用","zb":"合成了低负载量 Pd/Fe2O3 纳米催化剂。Fe2O3 选择性预凝聚过涂 ZnO 原子层沉积 (ALD)，使用 Zn(CH2CH3)2 和 H2O 作为前驱体，减弱了 Fe2O3 基位点的竞争性加氢反应活性。结果是在低负载量但高反应性的 Pd 位点提高了催化剂效率。这增加了对大多数水相氧化还原反应的催化剂效率，但抑制了对多芳香核底物的反应性。X 射线光电子能谱 (XPS) 和紫外光电子能谱 (UPS) 显示，ZnO 过涂层对 Pd 颗粒的电子影响最小，表明主要是物理位点阻挡效应是修改反应性的原因。这为稳定负载纳米催化剂和用超薄 ALD 过涂层改变反应性提供了一种概念验证。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及Fe/铁体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.4c03610","t":"Plasma-Assisted Ammonia Synthesis over La 2 O 3 Modified by RF Discharge: Effect of Oxygen Vacancies on N 2 Adsorption and Associative Mechanism","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.4c03610","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2024-07-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia, owing to its high hydrogen content and low storage cost, has emerged as a novel energy storage carrier for electricity-to-gas conversion. Plasma catalysis shows significant promise for sustainable ammonia synthesis due to its mild reaction conditions and zero carbon emissions. The filled catalyst can further enhance the efficiency of plasma-catalyzed ammonia synthesis. However, the performance of the catalyst needs to be improved, and catalyst modification can be a potential method. In this study, radio frequency discharge plasma was employed to treat the nonprecious metal oxide La 2 O 3, resulting in a plasma-assisted ammonia synthesis rate of 35.37 μmol/g/min. This rate is 16.5% higher than the untreated sample (30.36 μmol/g/min) and surpasses that of typical catalysts such as Al 2 O 3 (29.14 μmol/g/min) and MoO 2 (24.97 μmol/g/min). Characterization results from EPR and N 2 -","au":["Yunjie Li","She Chen","Kelin Li","Qihang Li","Mengbo Li","Linlin Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"射频放电等离子体辅助的氨合成：氧空位对 N2 吸附和关联机理的影响","zb":"研究对象为射频放电等离子体处理的 La2O3 催化剂，通过 EPR 和 N2-TPD 表征发现，射频等离子体处理显著增加了 La2O3 表面的氧空位含量并促进了 N2 化学吸附。DFT 计算研究了氧空位对 N2 吸附过程中电荷转移和电子结构的影响，并计算了 N2 在解离和关联机理下的反应路径。处理后的 La2O3 氨合成速率达到 35.37 μmol/g/min，比未处理样品高 16.5%，优于 Al2O3 和 MoO2。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.4900035","t":"Two-Stage 3d Porous Irregular Nanorod Electrode for Nitrate Electroreduction to Ammonia: Highly Ammonia Selectivity and Stability","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.4900035","s":"SSRN","d":"2024-07-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Jialu Shi","Li Tang","Zhanhui Shen","Linjie Ding"],"o":"回填","zt":"两阶段 3d 多孔不规则纳米棒电极用于硝酸盐电还原合成氨：高氨选择性和稳定性","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.4c07362","t":"Vacancy-Induced Anionic Electrons in Single-Metal Oxides and Their Possible Applications in Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.4c07362","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2024-07-18","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Realizating of a low work function (WF) and room-temperature stability in electrides is highly desired for various applications, such as electron emitters, catalysts, and ion batteries. Herein, a criterion based on the electron localization function (ELF) and projected density of states (PDOS) in the vacancy of the oxide electride [Ca24Al28O64]4+(4e-) (C12A7) was adopted to screen out 13 electrides in single-metal oxides. By creating oxygen vacancies in nonelectride oxides, we find out 9 of them showed vacancy-induced anionic electrons. Considering the thermodynamic stability, two electrides with ordered vacancies, Nb3O3 and Ce4O3, stand out and show vacancy-induced zero-dimensional anionic electrons. Both exhibit low WFs, namely 3.1 and 2.3 eV for Nb3O3 and Ce4O3, respectively. In the case of Nb3O3, the ELF at oxygen vacancies decreases first and then increases during the decrease in th","au":["Jingyu Yang","Jinbo Pan","Jun Deng","Yan-Fang Zhang","Yuhui Li","Yongqian Zhu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"单金属氧化物中空位诱导的阴离子电子及其在氨合成中的可能应用","zb":"通过 ELF 和 PDOS 筛选出 13 种单金属氧化物中的 9 种具有空位诱导的阴离子电子，其中 Nb3O3 和 Ce4O3 因其有序空位和低功函数（分别为 3.1 和 2.3 eV）而具有应用潜力。Ce4O3 在氨合成中表现出低氢扩散势垒和低活化能，CeO 中低浓度无序空位也显示出类似电子化合物特性。","top":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2024-b38rz","t":"Cost competitiveness of blue and green ammonia in future energy markets","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2024-b38rz","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2024-07-18","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Low-carbon ammonia can be produced at relevant scales through the conventional Haber-Bosch process paired with carbon capture and sequestration (blue ammonia) or using a renewable-driven Haber-Bosch process with hydrogen sourced from water electrolysis (green ammonia). The feasibility of each technology depends on the cost and availability of methane, green electricity, and the existence of carbon markets. To assess the feasibility of green and blue ammonia, we developed a detailed process model for each system and examined the energy, cost, and emissions associated with each system. We also assessed integration with the grid and intermittent operation from variable renewable energy resources on site. Our results suggest that an effective carbon tax of 50 USD/tCO2 would make blue ammonia feasible. However, for green ammonia to be a viable alternative to gray ammonia in all scenarios, the","au":["Carlos Fernandez","Oliver Chapman","Marilyn Brown","Marta Hatzell"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"蓝氨和绿氨在未来能源市场中的成本竞争力","zb":"通过建立详细过程模型评估了蓝氨（传统哈伯-博施工艺结合碳捕获与封存）和绿氨（可再生驱动的哈伯-博施工艺结合水电解制氢）的可行性。结果表明，50 USD/tCO2 的碳税可使蓝氨可行，而绿氨替代灰色氨需要 100–200 USD/tCO2 的碳税。绿氨仅在可再生能源和电解技术进步且天然气价格高的情况下优于蓝氨。","pre":1},{"id":"10.1039/d4tc01867b","t":"Surface chemistry in atomic layer deposition of AlN thin films from Al(CH3)3 and NH3 studied by mass spectrometry","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d4tc01867b","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry C","d":"2024-07-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Aluminum nitride (AlN) is a semiconductor with a very wide band gap and a potential dielectric material. Deposition of thin AlN films is routinely done by several techniques, including atomic layer deposition (ALD). In this study, we deposited AlN using ALD with trimethylaluminum (TMA) as the Al precursor and ammonia (NH3) with and without plasma activation as the N precursor in the temperature range from 100 to 400 °C while monitoring the surface reactions using mass spectrometry. Our results, combined with recent quantum chemical modelling, suggest that the surface chemistry of the deposition process is chemisorption of TMA followed by reductive elimination of the methyl groups to render mono methyl aluminum species. The NH3 chemisorption is done by ligand exchange to form CH4 and an -NH2 terminated surface.","au":["Pamburayi Mpofu","Houyem Hafdi","Pentti Niiranen","Jonas Lauridsen","Oscar Alm","Tommy Larsson"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过质谱研究 AlN 薄膜在原子层沉积中的表面化学","zb":"使用三甲基铝 (TMA) 作为 Al 前驱体和氨 (NH3) 作为 N 前驱体（有和没有等离子体激活）在 100 至 400 °C 范围内沉积 AlN，同时使用质谱监测表面反应。结果与最近的量子化学建模相结合，表明沉积过程的表面化学是 TMA 的化学吸附，然后是甲基的还原消除以形成单甲基铝物种。NH3 化学吸附是通过配体交换形成 CH4 和 -NH2 终止表面完成的。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","pp":"ChemRxiv"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.202408756","t":"In Situ Exsolved CoFeRu Alloy Decorated Perovskite as An Anode Catalyst Layer for High‐Performance Direct‐Ammonia Protonic Ceramic Fuel Cells","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.202408756","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2024-07-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Direct‐ammonia proton ceramic fuel cell (DA‐PCFC) is a promising clean energy technology because ammonia (NH 3 ) is easier to store, transport, and handle than hydrogen. However, NH 3 decomposition efficiency is unsatisfactory, and the anti‐sintering resistance of conventional Ni‐based ceramic anodes has limited the large‐scale application of DA‐PCFC technology. Herein, Pr 0.6 Sr 0.4 (Co 0.2 Fe 0.8 ) 0.85 Ru 0.15 O 3‐δ (PSCFR15), a novel anode catalyst layer (ACL) material is developed. PSCFR15 is treated under a reducing atmosphere to form a composite with CoFeRu alloy nanoparticles. Density functional theory simulations reveal that Ru modification in the CoFe alloy promotes nitrogen desorption during ammonia decomposition reaction, thereby boosting ammonia decomposition efficiency. As a result, DA‐PCFC with PSCFR15 ACL can achieve superior peak power density compared to bare D","au":["Mingzhuang Liang","Yufei Song","Baocheng Xiong","Dongliang Liu","Daxiang Xue","Longyun Shen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"原位析出 CoFeRu 合金装饰钙钛矿作为高性能直接氨质子陶瓷燃料电池的阳极催化剂层","zb":"开发了 Pr0.6Sr0.4(Co0.2Fe0.8)0.85Ru0.15O3-δ (PSCFR15) 阳极催化剂层材料，经还原气氛处理形成 CoFeRu 合金纳米颗粒复合物。DFT 模拟显示 Ru 修饰促进了氨分解反应中的氮脱附，提高了氨分解效率。PSCFR15 ACL 的 DA-PCFC 比使用 H2 和 NH3 燃料的裸 DA-PCFC 实现更高的峰值功率密度，并抑制了 Ni 烧结，增强了 DA-PCFC 的耐久性。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.3390/nano14141212","t":"Area-Selective Atomic Layer Deposition of Ru Using Carbonyl-Based Precursor and Oxygen Co-Reactant: Understanding Defect Formation Mechanisms","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/nano14141212","s":"Nanomaterials","d":"2024-07-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Area selective deposition (ASD) is a promising IC fabrication technique to address misalignment issues arising in a top–down litho-etch patterning approach. ASD can enable resist tone inversion and bottom–up metallization, such as via prefill. It is achieved by promoting selective growth in the growth area (GA) while passivating the non-growth area (NGA). Nevertheless, preventing undesired particles and defect growth on the NGA is still a hurdle. This work shows the selectivity of Ru films by passivating the Si oxide NGA with self-assembled monolayers (SAMs) and small molecule inhibitors (SMIs). Ru films are deposited on the TiN GA using a metal-organic precursor tricarbonyl (trimethylenemethane) ruthenium (Ru TMM(CO)3) and O2 as a co-reactant by atomic layer deposition (ALD). This produces smooth Ru films (<0.1 nm RMS roughness) with a growth per cycle (GPC) of 1.6 Å/cycle. Minimizing t","au":["Jayant Kumar Lodha","Johan Meersschaut","Mattia Pasquali","Hans Billington","Stefan De Gendt","Silvia Armini"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"使用羰基前驱体和氧共反应剂进行区域选择原子层沉积 Ru：理解缺陷形成机制","zb":"研究区域选择沉积 (ASD) 技术在解决自上而下光刻蚀方法中错位问题上的潜力。通过钝化非生长区 (NGA) 并在生长区 (GA) 促进选择性生长实现 ASD。本研究使用自组装单层膜 (SAMs) 和小分子抑制剂 (SMIs) 钝化 SiO2 NGA，在 TiN GA 上使用金属有机前驱体三羰基 (三甲烯基甲烷) 钌 (Ru TMM(CO)3) 和 O2 进行原子层沉积 (ALD) 沉积 Ru 薄膜。得到粗糙度 <0.1 nm RMS 的平滑 Ru 薄膜，每周期生长 (GPC) 为 1.6 Å/cycle。由于有机分子稳定性有限和 ALD 前驱体高反应性，最小化氧共反应剂剂量可提高 ASD 过程选择性，仍允许 Ru GPC 为 0.95 Å/cycle。通过分析粒子生长、覆盖率和密度随 ALD 周期的变化，阐明了钝化区域 Ru 缺陷生成机制。最后，使用二甲基氨基三甲基硅烷 (DMA-TMS)","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.4c02872","t":"Reduced Graphene Oxide/Titanium Dioxide Nanocomposites via Atomic Layer Deposition for Microwave Absorption","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.4c02872","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2024-07-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The reduced graphene oxide/titanium dioxide (RGO/TiO 2 ) nanocomposites were first prepared by the atomic layer deposition (ALD) method for microwave absorbing. The deposition content of TiO 2 nanoparticles on the RGO surface was precisely adjusted by manipulating the number of ALD cycles. On the one hand, the appropriate TiO 2 nanoparticles can precisely regulate the impedance matching to obtain lightweight nanocomposites. On the other hand, the interfaces between RGO and TiO 2 can be regulated to retain active sites when the number of ALD cycles is low. Thus, impedance matching and attenuation ability of the composites could be regulated. The microstructure of RGO/TiO 2 nanocomposites was characterized by SEM, TEM, and XPS, and the relationship between microstructures and microwave absorption properties was also investigated in detail. The RGO/TiO 2 nanocomposites possessed high microw","au":["Qianshan Xia","Xuetao Wang","Zhiyuan Huang","Lingzhi Chen","Chengqi Li","Guozheng Lv"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积制备的还原氧化石墨烯/二氧化钛纳米复合材料用于微波吸收","zb":"利用原子层沉积法在还原氧化石墨烯表面沉积二氧化钛纳米颗粒，通过调节沉积循环次数调控界面阻抗匹配与衰减能力。RGO/TiO2纳米复合材料表现出优异的微波吸收性能，在150次循环时最大反射损耗达-41.3 dB，有效吸收带宽覆盖4.88 GHz的Ku波段。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/advs.202405351","t":"Flash Joule Heating: A Promising Method for Preparing Heterostructure Catalysts to Inhibit Polysulfide Shuttling in Li–S Batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/advs.202405351","s":"Advanced Science","d":"2024-07-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract The “shuttle effect” issue severely hinders the practical application of lithium–sulfur (Li–S) batteries, which is primarily caused by the significant accumulation of lithium polysulfides in the electrolyte. Designing effective catalysts is highly desired for enhancing polysulfide conversion to address the above issue. Here, the one‐step flash‐Joule‐heating route is employed to synthesize a W‐W 2 C heterostructure on the graphene substrate (W‐W 2 C/G) as a catalytic interlayer for this purpose. Theoretical calculations reveal that the work function difference between W (5.08 eV) and W 2 C (6.31 eV) induces an internal electric field at the heterostructure interface, accelerating the movement of electrons and ions, thus promoting the sulfur reduction reaction (SRR) process. The high catalytic activity is also confirmed by the reduced activation energy and suppressed polysulfide s","au":["Huiyi Dong","Lu Wang","Yi Cheng","Huiyue Sun","Tianqi You","Jingjing Qie"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"闪焦耳加热：制备抑制锂硫电池多硫化物穿梭效应的异质结构催化剂的一种有前景的方法","zb":"采用一步闪焦耳加热路线在石墨烯基底上合成 W-W2C 异质结构 (W-W2C/G) 作为催化中间层。理论计算表明，W (5.08 eV) 和 W2C (6.31 eV) 之间的功函数差在异质结构界面诱导了内部电场，加速了电子和离子的运动，从而促进了硫还原反应 (SRR) 过程。通过 W-W2C/G 中间层，锂硫电池表现出优异的倍率性能 (665 mAh g−1 at 5.0 C) 和稳定的循环性能，在 3.0 C 的高倍率下循环 1000 次的衰减率为 0.06%。此外，在 7.9 mg cm−2 的高面积硫负载和 9.0 µL mg−1 的低电解质/硫比下，获得了 10.9 mAh cm−2 的高面容量 (1381.4 mAh g−1)。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.3390/ma17143502","t":"ZnO:CuO Composites Obtained by Rapid Joule Heating for Photocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/ma17143502","s":"Materials","d":"2024-07-15","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Semiconductor oxides belonging to various families are ideal candidates for application in photocatalytic processes. One of the challenges facing photocatalytic processes today is improving their efficiency under sunlight irradiation. In this study, the growth and characterization of semiconductor oxide nanostructures and composites based on the ZnO and CuO families are proposed. The selected growth method is the resistive heating of Zn and Cu wires to produce the corresponding oxides, combined with galvanic corrosion of Zn. An exhaustive characterization of the materials obtained has been carried out using techniques based on scanning electron microscopy and optical spectroscopies. The method we have followed and the conditions used in this study present promising results, not only from a degradation efficiency point of view but also because it is a cheap, easy, and fast growth method. ","au":["Adrián Fernández-Calzado","Aarón Calvo-Villoslada","Paloma Fernández","Belén Sotillo"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"用于光催化的快速焦耳加热制备ZnO:CuO复合材料","zb":"采用电阻加热锌和铜丝并结合锌的电化学腐蚀方法，快速生长和表征了基于ZnO和CuO家族的半导体氧化物纳米结构和复合材料。通过扫描电子显微镜和光学光谱进行了全面表征，该方法不仅降解效率高，而且成本低、易操作、速度快，有利于工艺的规模化。","ob":"通用催化方法"},{"id":"10.1115/es2024-131382","t":"Resistive Heating Catalytic Micro-Reactor Design for Process Intensified Fuel Reforming to Hydrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1115/es2024-131382","s":"ASME 2024 18th International Conference on Energy Sustainability","d":"2024-07-15","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract For the increasing demand for fuel flexibility in H2 production for fuel cells, the process intensification of fuel reforming using micro-reactors has become crucial. While prior literature has seen substantial progress in hydrocarbon fuel reforming within micro-reactors employing micro-channels, the supply of thermal energy for these endothermic reactions has faced limitations, relying on external heating, or operating in autothermal mode through partial combustion. This paper explores a novel approach by investigating the use of a thin-film catalytic heater for the development of micro-reactors. The study specifically focuses on dry methane reforming, showcasing a simplified micro-reactor where thermal energy is supplied through electric resistive heating of a thin carbon sheet with a catalyst applied to its surface. The thin catalytic heated layer resides inside the reactor, ","au":["Kiran Raj Goud Burra","Murat Sahin","Ashwani Gupta"],"o":"回填","why":["Resistive Heat"],"zt":"用于过程强化燃料重整制氢的电阻加热催化微反应器设计","zb":"为满足燃料电池用 H2 生产对燃料灵活性的需求，使用微反应器强化燃料重整变得至关重要。本研究探索使用薄膜催化加热器开发微反应器的新方法，重点关注干甲烷重整。展示了一个简化的微反应器，通过电电阻加热薄碳片并在其表面施加催化剂来提供热能。薄催化加热层位于反应器内部，最小化能量损失并显著减小反应器尺寸。功率输入从 90 W 变化到 225 W，以了解其对反应器内部温度、CH4 转化程度、H2 和 CO 收率的影响。由于使用碳纸作为加热薄膜，实现了快速热响应时间。Ni/MgO 沉积在碳纸上作为催化加热元件，在温度高于 750 K 时 CH4 转化率超过 60%。还研究了操作条件（如 CO2/CH4 输入摩尔比和气 hourly 空间速度 (GHSV)）的影响，以了解该设置中催化剂的适用范围。测试了高 GHSVs (592,885 和 948,617 mL/(hr.gcatalyst))，以了解该设","ob":"其他催化反应"},{"id":"10.1002/smtd.202400530","t":"Lattice‐Confined Single‐Atom Catalyst: Preparation, Application and Electron Regulation Mechanism","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smtd.202400530","s":"Small Methods","d":"2024-07-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Lattice‐confined single‐atom catalyst (LC SAC), featuring exceptional activity, intriguing stability and prominent selectivity, has attracted extensive attention in the fields of various reactions (e.g., hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), oxygen evolution reaction (OER), oxygen reduction reaction (ORR), etc.). To design a “smart” LC SAC for catalytic applications, one must systematically comprehend updated advances in the preparation, the application, and especially the peculiar electron regulation mechanism of LC SAC. In this review, the specific preparation methods of LC SAC based on general coordination strategy are updated, and its applications in HER, OER, ORR, N 2 reduction reaction (NRR), advanced oxidation processes (AOPs) and so forth are summarized to display outstanding activity, stability and selectivity. Uniquely, the electron regulation mechanisms are first and dee","au":["Ting Ma","Haibo Li","Yanyan Yu","Kaixuan Wang","Wei Yu","Yu Shang"],"o":"回填","why":["NRR"],"zt":"晶格限域单原子催化剂：制备、应用和电子调控机制","zb":"晶格限域单原子催化剂（LC SAC）因其优异的活性、稳定性和选择性，在多种反应（如析氢反应（HER）、析氧反应（OER）、氧还原反应（ORR）等）领域备受关注。本文综述了基于通用配位策略的LC SAC的制备方法，总结了其在析氢反应（HER）、析氧反应（OER）、氧还原反应（ORR）、氮气还原反应（NRR）、高级氧化工艺（AOPs）等领域的应用，展示了其出色的活性、稳定性和选择性。首次深入讨论了电子调控机制，主要包括单金属活性位点的电子转移桥、多金属活性位点的全新催化中心和周围环境的积极影响。最后提出了现有问题和未来发展方向，以期进一步优化LC SAC的性能。本综述旨在促进高效LC SAC的深入理解和实际应用。","ob":"通用催化方法"},{"id":"10.3390/molecules29143314","t":"Density Functional Theory Study of Triple Transition Metal Cluster Anchored on the C2N Monolayer for Nitrogen Reduction Reactions","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/molecules29143314","s":"Molecules","d":"2024-07-13","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) is an attractive pathway for producing ammonia under ambient conditions. The development of efficient catalysts for nitrogen fixation in electrochemical NRRs has become increasingly important, but it remains challenging due to the need to address the issues of activity and selectivity. Herein, using density functional theory (DFT), we explore ten kinds of triple transition metal atoms (M3 = Sc, Ti, V, Cr, Mn, Fe, Co, Ni, Cu, and Zn) anchored on the C2N monolayer (M3-C2N) as NRR electrocatalysts. The negative binding energies of M3 clusters on C2N mean that the triple transition metal clusters can be stably anchored on the N6 cavity of the C2N structure. As the first step of the NRR, the adsorption configurations of N2 show that the N2 on M3-C2N catalysts can be stably adsorbed in a side-on mode, except for Zn3-C2N. Moreover, the exten","au":["Shifa Xiao","Daoqing Zhang","Guangzhao Wang","Tianhang Zhou","Ning Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["producing ammonia"],"ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.4c03875","t":"Unlocking the Potential of MXene in Catalysis: Decorated Mo 2 CT x Catalyst for Ammonia Synthesis under Mild Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.4c03875","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2024-07-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"Ammonia, which is one of the most important chemicals for the synthesis of dyes, pharmaceuticals, and fertilizers, is produced by the reaction of molecular hydrogen with nitrogen, over an iron-based catalyst at 400–500 °C under pressure of over 100 bar. Decreasing the operating temperature and pressure of this highly energy-intensive process, developed by Haber and Bosch over 100 years ago, would decrease energy consumption in the world. In this work, we used two-dimensional Mo2CT x MXene as a support for a cobalt-based catalyst. The MXene functionalized by Co showed catalytic activity for ammonia synthesis from H2 and N2 at temperatures as low as 250 °C, without any pretreatment. The developed catalyst was highly active for ammonia synthesis, demonstrating a high rate of up to 9500 μmol g–1 active phase h–1 at 400 °C under ambient pressure in steady-state conditions, and did not suffer ","au":["Amanda Sfeir","Christopher E. Shuck","Alexandre Fadel","Maya Marinova","Hervé Vezin","Jean-Philippe Dacquin"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"解锁 MXene 在催化中的潜力：用于温和条件下氨合成的 Mo2CTx 装饰催化剂","zb":"利用二维 Mo2CTx MXene 作为载体负载钴基催化剂，在 250 °C 下无需预处理即可催化 H2 和 N2 合成氨。该催化剂在 400 °C 和常压下表现出高达 9500 μmol g–1 h–1 的活性，且在 15 天内无失活，表观活化能为 68–74 kJ mol–1。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.4c06098","t":"Polynuclear Cobalt Cluster-Based Coordination Polymers for Efficient Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electroreduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.4c06098","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2024-07-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NITRR) holds great promise for purifying wastewater and producing valuable ammonia (NH3). However, the lack of efficient electrocatalysts has impeded the achievement of highly selective NH3 synthesis from the NITRR. In this study, we report the design and synthesis of two polynuclear Co-cluster-based coordination polymers, {[Co2(TCPPDA)(H2O)5]·(H2O)9(DMF)} and {Co1.5(TCPPDA)[(CH3)2NH2]·(H2O)6(DMF)2} (namely, NJUZ-2 and NJUZ-3), which possess distinct coordination motifs with well-defined porosity, high-density catalytic sites, accessible mass transfer channels, and nanoconfined chemical environments. Benefitting from their intriguing multicore metal-organic coordination framework structures, NJUZ-2 and NJUZ-3 exhibit remarkable catalytic activities for the NITRR. At a potential of -0.8 V (vs. RHE) in an H-type cell, they achieve an optimal","au":["Miao Wang","Shufan Li","Yuming Gu","Wenjie Xu","Huaizhu Wang","Jingjie Sun"],"o":"回填","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"基于多核钴簇的配位聚合物用于高效的硝酸盐到氨的电还原","zb":"电催化硝酸盐还原反应（NITRR）在水处理和有价值氨（NH3）生产方面具有巨大潜力。然而，缺乏高效的电催化剂阻碍了从NITRR中实现高度选择性的NH3合成。本研究报道了两种基于多核钴簇的配位聚合物，{[Co2(TCPPDA)(H2O)5]·(H2O)9(DMF)}和{Co1.5(TCPPDA)[(CH3)2NH2]·(H2O)6(DMF)2}（即NJUZ-2和NJUZ-3），它们具有不同的配位基序、明确的孔隙率、高密度催化位点、可及的质量传递通道和纳米限域的化学环境。受益于其有趣的多核金属-有机配位框架结构，NJUZ-2和NJUZ-3对NITRR表现出显著的催化活性。在H型电池中-0.8 V（vs. RHE）的电位下，它们实现了约98.5%的法拉第效率和选择性NH3生产的高长期耐久性。此外，即使在强酸性条件下，电催化性能也保持良好。在工业相关电流密度469.9 mA cm-2的流动电池中，","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.4c01510","t":"Surface Engineering on Ag-Decorated Co 3 O 4 Electrocatalysts for Boosting Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.4c01510","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2024-07-12","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 – RR) offers an alternative pathway toward ambient ammonia production and nitrogen balance restoration, requiring efficient catalysts. In this study, a silver-decorated cobalt oxide (Ag–Co 3 O 4 ) catalyst was shown to enhance ammonia production during NO 3 – RR in an alkaline electrolyte. Specifically, the Ag–Co 3 O 4 catalyst delivers an ammonia (NH 3 ) yield rate of 52 μmol h –1 cm –2 with a Faradaic efficiency of 88% at −0.32 V versus RHE. The activity is 6 times higher than that of the conventional Co 3 O 4 catalyst (8.8 μmol h –1 cm –2 ). The catalytic activity and selectivity of Ag–Co 3 O 4 originate from the interaction between atomically dispersed Ag and Co 3 O 4, resulting in the formation of active octahedral Co 2+ species (Co 2+ Oh ) with an unpaired e g electron, which facilitates the activation and adsorption of NO 3 – ion an","au":["Ming Zhang","Zhipeng Ma","Shujie Zhou","Chen Han","Varun Kundi","Priyank V. Kumar"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"Ag装饰的Co3O4电催化剂的表面工程用于增强硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"本研究表明，银装饰的氧化钴（Ag–Co3O4）催化剂在碱性电解质中NO3–RR过程中增强了氨的生成。具体而言，Ag–Co3O4催化剂在-0.32 V（vs RHE）下提供52 μmol h–1 cm–2的氨（NH3）产率率和88%的法拉第效率。该活性是传统Co3O4催化剂（8.8 μmol h–1 cm–2）的6倍。Ag–Co3O4的催化活性和选择性源于原子分散的Ag和Co3O4之间的相互作用，形成了具有未成对eg电子的活性八面体Co2+物种（Co2+ Oh），这促进了NO3–离子的活化和吸附，并促进了*NO2吸附及其转化为*NO中间体。这导致了高效的NH4+生成，实验和理论研究均证实了这一点。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d4nr01984a","t":"Electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction to ammonia by atomically precise Cu 6 nanoclusters supported on graphene oxide","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d4nr01984a","s":"Nanoscale","d":"2024-07-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"A Cu 6 (SMPP) 6 nanocluster is synthesized and supported on graphene oxide for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction to ammonia, showing decent NH 3 yield rate and faradaic efficiency.","au":["Aamir Shehzad","Chaonan Cui","Ran Cheng","Zhixun Luo"],"o":"回填","why":["Electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"原子精确的Cu6纳米簇负载在氧化石墨烯上用于电催化氮还原为氨","zb":"合成并负载在氧化石墨烯上的Cu6 (SMPP)6纳米簇用于电催化氮还原为氨，显示出不错的NH3产率和法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.4c01924","t":"CuCo 2 O 4 /CuO Heterostructure with Oxygen Vacancies Induced by Plasma for Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.4c01924","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2024-07-12","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction (NO3RR) to ammonia production is regarded as one of the potential alternatives for replacing the Haber-Bosch technology for realizing artificial ammonia synthesis. In this study, a CuCo2O4/CuO-Ar heterostructure in the shape of dandelion nanospheres formed by nanoarrays has been successfully constructed, demonstrating excellent NO3RR performance. Experimental results indicate that Ar plasma etching of CuCo2O4/CuO-Ar significantly increases the content of oxygen vacancies compared to the sample of CuCo2O4/CuO-Air etched by air plasma, resulting in improved NO3RR performance. Density functional theory calculations further confirm that the existence of more oxygen vacancies effectively decreases the energy barrier of nitrate adsorption, which is due to the generation of more oxygen vacancies facilitating nitrate adsorption and weakening the N-O bonds of nit","au":["Xu Liu","Xuetao Cheng","Huilin Zhao","Pengfei Liu","Yan-Qin Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"等离子体诱导氧空位的CuCo2O4/CuO异质结构用于电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"本研究成功构建了由纳米阵列形成的蒲公英状纳米球形的CuCo2O4/CuO-Ar异质结构，表现出优异的硝酸盐还原（NO3RR）性能。实验结果表明，与由空气等离子体刻蚀的CuCo2O4/CuO相比，Ar等离子体刻蚀的CuCo2O4/CuO-Ar显著增加了氧空位的含量，从而提高了NO3RR性能。密度泛函理论计算进一步证实，氧空位的存在有效地降低了硝酸盐吸附的能量势垒，这是因为氧空位的产生促进了硝酸盐吸附，并在等离子体处理后削弱了硝酸盐的N-O键。因此，CuCo2O4/CuO-Ar在最佳电位-0.9 V（vs RHE）的中性介质中表现出0.55 mmol h-1 cm-2的高氨产率和95.07%的法拉第效率。重要的是，CuCo2O4/CuO-Ar还展示了优异的电催化稳定性。本研究为NO3RR电催化剂的设计和结构调控提供了新观点，并探讨了其在未来的潜在应用。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/pssa.202400387","t":"Atomic Layer Deposited Al 1− x Ni x O: Low Contact Resistivity Hole‐Selective Contact for Crystalline Silicon Solar Cells","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/pssa.202400387","s":"physica status solidi (a)","d":"2024-07-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Transition metal oxide (TMO)/crystalline silicon (c‐Si) junction‐based heterostructure crystalline silicon solar cells have emerged as a promising alternative to traditional silicon solar cells. However, the power conversion efficiency of c‐Si solar cells utilizing a nickel oxide (NiO x ) hole transport layer (HTL) still lags behind those employing a fully developed TMO layer. This disparity may be attributed, at least in part, to inefficient hole extraction. Atomic layer deposited (ALD) aluminum nickel oxide (Al 1 − x Ni x O) films, synthesized using bis( N,N′‐di‐t ‐butylacetamidinato)nickel(II) (NiAMD) and trimethylaluminum (TMA) as precursors, along with deionized water as a co‐reactant, have been observed to improve the contact properties with p‐type silicon compared to NiO x . Al 1− x Ni x O films with varying Al concentrations (0.25, 0.44, and 0.87) are examined for their contact p","au":["Yang Hong","Xuanfei Kuang","Yongjuan Chen","Yao Xiao","Zongcun Liang"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积 Al 1− x Ni x O：低接触电阻空穴选择接触用于晶体硅太阳能电池","zb":"过渡金属氧化物 (TMO)/晶体硅 (c‐Si) 结异质结构晶体硅太阳能电池已成为传统硅太阳能电池的有希望的替代品。然而，使用镍氧化物 (NiO x ) 空穴传输层 (HTL) 的 c‐Si 太阳能电池的功率转换效率仍落后于使用完全开发的 TMO 层的电池。这种差距至少可部分归因于空穴提取效率低下。通过双 ( N,N′‐二‐叔丁基乙酰胺) 镍(II) (NiAMD) 和三甲基铝 (TMA) 作为前驱体，以及去离子水作为共反应剂，原子层沉积 (ALD) 铝镍氧化物 (Al 1 − x Ni x O) 薄膜已被观察到与 p‐型硅的接触性能优于 NiO x 。Al 1− x Ni x O 薄膜具有不同的 Al 浓度 (0.25, 0.44 和 0.87)，在 p ‐Si 上检查其接触性能，得到最低的接触电阻 85 mΩ cm 2 。优化的 Al 1 − x Ni x O 薄膜表现出优异的从 p‐"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202406404","t":"Catalytic Nitrogen Fixation Using Well‐Defined Molecular Catalysts under Ambient or Mild Reaction Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202406404","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2024-07-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia (NH 3 ) is industrially produced from dinitrogen (N 2 ) and dihydrogen (H 2 ) by the Haber–Bosch process, although H 2 is prepared from fossil fuels, and the reaction requires harsh conditions. On the other hand, microorganisms have fixed nitrogen under ambient reaction conditions. Recently, well‐defined molecular transition metal complexes have been found to work as catalyst to convert N 2 into NH 3 by reactions with chemical reductants and proton sources under ambient reaction conditions. Among them, involvement of both N 2 ‐splitting pathway and proton‐coupled electron transfer is found to be very effective for high catalytic activity. Furthermore, direct electrocatalytic and photocatalytic conversions of N 2 into NH 3 have been recently achieved. In addition to catalytic formation of NH 3 , selective catalytic conversion of N 2 into hydrazine (NH 2 NH 2 ) and catalyt","au":["Yoshiaki Tanabe","Yoshiaki Nishibayashi"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202402301","t":"Exceptional Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia Catalyst Enabled by BO 2 − Anion Induction Effects Combining Heterogeneous Branching Architecture‐Driven Mass Transport Enhancement","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202402301","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2024-07-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract In this paper, an exceptional nitrate reduction to ammonia catalyst is reported, enabled by BO 2 − anion induction effects combining heterogeneous branching architecture‐driven mass transport enhancement strategies. The implantation of the BO 2 − anion can inductively enhance the electron cloud density and electron transmission paths of intrinsic catalysts, makes electron more active to improve the conductivity, regulates the adsorption and desorption rates of intermediates by space barrier effect, reduces the binding energy of the electron and 3d orbital of Ni in NiFe(BO 2 )O(OH), thereby lowing the transform free energy of the determining * NO 3 to * HNO 3 step. 3D hollow sea urchin lattice heterogeneous branching structure can self‐drive generate differentiated micro convection intervals, which will be beneficial for improving mass transfer dynamics especially localized distu","au":["Liping Ding","Han Yan","Lin Zhang","Ruijie Bai","Qian Du","Chun Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"由 BO 2 − 阴离子诱导效应结合异质分支结构驱动的质量传输增强实现的优异硝酸盐还原为氨催化剂","zb":"报道了一种由 BO 2 − 阴离子诱导效应结合异质分支结构驱动的质量传输增强策略实现的优异硝酸盐还原为氨催化剂。BO 2 − 阴离子的植入可以诱导增强内在催化剂的电子云密度和电子传输路径，使电子更活跃以提高导电性，通过空间势垒效应调节中间体的吸附和解吸速率，降低电子与 NiFe(BO 2 )O(OH) 中 Ni 的 3d 轨道的结合能，从而降低决定性 NO 3 到 HNO 3 步骤的转换自由能。3D 中空海胆晶格异质分支结构可以自驱动生成差异化的微观对流区间，这将有利于提高质量传输动力学，特别是催化剂对硝酸盐还原反应 (NO 3 RR) 催化过程的局部扰动质量传输效应。所制备的 3D NiFe 间硼酸盐水合物中空仿生海胆晶格催化剂在低 -0.25V(vs RHE) NO 3 RR 电位下具有 6.27mmol·h −1 ·cm −2 的高 NH 3 产率和 98.7% 的法拉第效率。此外，","ob":"通用催化方法","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d4ta03350g","t":"Enhanced photoelectrochemical nitrogen reduction to ammonia by a plasmon-active Au grating decorated with the gC 3 N 4 @MoS 2 heterosystem and plasmon-active nanoparticles","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d4ta03350g","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2024-07-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical production of ammonia from nitrogen (so-called nitrogen reduction reaction - NRR) is one of the key tasks of modern electrochemistry. The use of photo-electrochemical approaches in NRR allows...","au":["Denis Zabelin","Anastasiia Tulupova","Anna Zabelina","Andrea Tosovska","Rashid Valiev","Ruslan Ramazanov"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsenergylett.4c01655","t":"Effect of Lithium Salt on Lithium-Mediated Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.4c01655","s":"ACS Energy Letters","d":"2024-07-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"High Resolution Image Download MS PowerPoint Slide Recently, the lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) has emerged as a promising approach for electrochemical ammonia synthesis, facilitating more localized production. However, the systematic investigation of lithium salts in this process, especially when coupled with a hydrogen oxidation reaction (HOR) at the anode side in a continuous-flow reactor, remains largely underexplored. This study systematically investigates the effects of various lithium salts on Li-NRR selectivity and efficiency in a continuous-flow reactor coupled with the HOR at the anode. Among the evaluated salts, lithium tetrafluoroborate (LiBF 4 ) demonstrated the highest NH 3 selectivity of 61% under ambient conditions. Conversely, lithium bis(trifluoromethanesulfonyl)imide (LiTFSI) showed a significantly lower Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 18%, due to it","au":["Xianbiao Fu","Shaofeng Li","Niklas H. Deissler","Jon Bjarke Valbæk Mygind","Jakob Kibsgaard","Ib Chorkendorff"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"锂盐对锂介导的氨合成的影响","zb":"最近，锂介导的氮还原反应 (Li-NRR) 已成为电化学氨合成的一种有前景的方法，促进更局部的生产。然而，在连续流反应器中，特别是在阳极侧耦合氢氧化反应 (HOR) 时，对锂盐在此过程中的系统研究仍然很大程度上未得到探索。本研究系统地研究了各种锂盐对连续流反应器中 Li-NRR 选择性和效率的影响，该反应器与阳极侧的 HOR 耦合。在评估的盐中，四氟硼酸锂 (LiBF 4 ) 在环境条件下表现出 61% 的高 NH 3 选择性。相反，双 (三氟甲烷磺酰) 胺锂 (LiTFSI) 显示出 18% 的显著较低法拉第效率 (FE)，这是由于其分解并随后对 HOR 催化剂造成硫中毒。这些发现突出了选择适当的锂盐和建立更高效和稳定电解质的关键设计原则的重要性，以推进 Li-NRR 和可持续氨合成。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cssc.202400448","t":"Bionic Design of Iron‐Doped MoSe 2 Catalyst for Efficient Nitrogen Fixation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cssc.202400448","s":"ChemSusChem","d":"2024-07-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The catalytic system of biological nitrogen fixation in nature primarily relies on the “FeMo cofactor” within nitrogenase enzymes. Inspired by this natural structure, we have designed a bionic inorganic counterpart, iron‐doped MoSe 2 , for the efficient electroreduction of dinitrogen to ammonia. The introduced Fe dopant significantly enhances nitrogen fixation activity of MoSe 2 . Furthermore, we constructed a heterostructure catalyst, the Fe‐MoSe 2 /Mo 2 C with more versatile Mo valence states. The heterostructured electrocatalyst achieves an ammonia production rate of 3.38 μg cm −2 h −1 , and a Faradaic efficiency of 30.8 %, which is ~5 fold higher than that of pristine MoSe 2 . This study presents a novel approach for designing bionic nitrogen fixation electrocatalysts.","au":["Tong Ye","Hongbin Li","Taishi Xiao","Zhengzong Sun"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"仿生设计的铁掺杂 MoSe 2 催化剂用于高效的氮固定","zb":"受自然界生物固氮中氮酶酶蛋白内的“FeMo 辅因子”结构启发，设计了一种仿生无机对应物，即铁掺杂 MoSe 2 ，用于高效的电还原氮气为氨。引入的 Fe 掺杂剂显著增强了 MoSe 2 的氮固定活性。此外，构建了一种异质结构催化剂，即 Fe‐MoSe 2 /Mo 2 C ，具有更多样化的 Mo 化合价状态。该异质结构电催化剂实现了 3.38 μg cm −2 h −1 的氨产率和 30.8 % 的法拉第效率，比原始 MoSe 2 高约 5 倍。这项研究提出了一种设计仿生氮固定电催化剂的新方法。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/molecules29143276","t":"Study of Ammonia Adsorption on Magnetite Surfaces with Molecular Dynamics Simulations","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/molecules29143276","s":"Molecules","d":"2024-07-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The present study proposes an atomistic molecular dynamics model system of a magnetite (Fe3O4) {111} surface. The effect of temperature on the adsorption process of ammonia (NH3) at low concentrations in the aqueous phase has been considered. The molecular dynamics simulations were carried out using the Clay force field (Clay FF) with a modification for the iron atoms in the NPT ensemble at a pressure of 90 bar. The considered system was heated in a temperature range from 293 to 473 K, and additional relaxations were performed at temperatures of interest. Within the scope of this study, the basic parameters of the magnetite surface were calculated and the distances between the ammonia molecules and the surface were determined. A general idea of the degree and rate of adsorption at specific temperatures was obtained. The calculation results were compared to the experimental data where pos","au":["Nikoleta Ivanova","Vasil Karastoyanov","Iva Betova","Martin Bojinov"],"o":"回填","zt":"利用分子动力学模拟研究磁铁矿表面氨吸附","zb":"本研究提出了一种磁铁矿（Fe3O4）{111}表面的原子尺度分子动力学模型系统。研究了温度对水相中低浓度氨（NH3）吸附过程的影响。采用 Clay 力场（Clay FF）对铁原子进行修改，在 NPT 系综下以 90 bar 的压力进行了分子动力学模拟。该系统在 293 K 至 473 K 的温度范围内加热，并在感兴趣的温度下进行了额外的弛豫。在此研究范围内，计算了磁铁矿表面的基本参数，并确定了氨分子与表面之间的距离。获得了特定温度下吸附程度和速率的总体概念。计算结果尽可能与实验数据和其他可用的金属氧化物吸附过程模拟结果进行了比较。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.4891967","t":"Ammonia Scavenging by the Diazotroph Azospirillum Brasilense Improves Wheat Seedlings’ Nitrogen Budget","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.4891967","s":"SSRN","d":"2024-07-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Teresa Dias","Kamran Azmaliyev","Juliana Melo","Ana Margarida Santos","Patrícia Correia","Cristina Cruz"],"o":"回填","zt":"固氮菌 Azospirillum Brasilense 对氨的清除改善了小麦幼苗的氮平衡","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/sus2.226","t":"V 2 O 3 /VN electrocatalysts with coherent heterogeneous interfaces for selecting low‐energy nitrogen reduction pathways","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/sus2.226","s":"SusMat","d":"2024-07-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) is a sustainable alternative to the Haber‒Bosch process for ammonia (NH 3 ) production. However, the significant uphill energy in the multistep NRR pathway is a bottleneck for favorable serial reactions. To overcome this challenge, we designed a vanadium oxide/nitride (V 2 O 3 /VN) hybrid electrocatalyst in which V 2 O 3 and VN coexist coherently at the heterogeneous interface. Since single‐phase V 2 O 3 and VN exhibit different surface catalytic kinetics for NRR, the V 2 O 3 /VN hybrid electrocatalyst can provide alternating reaction pathways, selecting a lower energy pathway for each material in the serial NRR pathway. As a result, the ammonia yield of the V 2 O 3 /VN hybrid electrocatalyst was 219.6 µg h −1 cm −2 , and the Faradaic efficiency was 18.9%, which is much higher than that of single‐phase VN, V 2 O 3 , and VN x O y ","au":["Tae‐Yong An","Chengkai Xia","Minyeong Je","Hyunjung Lee","Seulgi Ji","Min‐Cheol Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"具有相干异质界面的 V 2 O 3 /VN 电催化剂用于选择低能氮还原途径","zb":"电化学氮还原反应 (NRR) 是哈伯-博施过程的一种可持续替代方法，用于氨 (NH 3 ) 生产。然而，多步 NRR 途径中的显著升坡能垒是利于串联反应的瓶颈。为克服这一挑战，我们设计了一种钒氧化物/氮化物 (V 2 O 3 /VN) 混合电催化剂，其中 V 2 O 3 和 VN 在异质界面处共存相干。由于单相 V 2 O 3 和 VN 对 NRR 表面催化动力学不同，V 2 O 3 /VN 混合电催化剂可以在串联 NRR 途径中为每种材料提供交替反应途径，选择每个材料上的较低能量途径。结果，V 2 O 3 /VN 混合电催化剂的氨产率为 219.6 µg h −1 cm −2 ，法拉第效率为 18.9% ，远高于没有异质界面的单相 VN、V 2 O 3 和 VN x O y 固溶体催化剂。密度泛函理论计算证实，这些混合电催化剂的组成允许 NRR 通过中间物种的迁移和吸附从多步还原反应转变","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adem.202301724","t":"Constructing Conductive MoO x Thin Films by Plasma‐Enhanced Atomic Layer Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adem.202301724","s":"Advanced Engineering Materials","d":"2024-07-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Herein, amorphous molybdenum oxide films are constructed by thermal atomic layer deposition (T‐ALD) and plasma‐enhanced atomic layer deposition (PE‐ALD). The physical and chemical properties of molybdenum oxide films prepared by the two methods are systematically compared by means of film growth law, atomic force microscope, scanning electron microscope, etc. The results show that the amorphous molybdenum oxide physical phase prepared by both ALD methods is MoO 3 . Compared with T‐ALD MoO 3 , the growth rate of MoO 3 thin films prepared by PE‐ALD is higher. Compared to PE‐ALD MoO 3 , the MoO 3 films prepared by T‐ALD did not have nucleation delayed to a laminar growth mode, resulting in smoother deposited films and contained less impurity carbon. The MoO 3 prepared by PE‐ALD contains 7.4% impurity carbon. This carbon‐doped film significantly improves the conductivity of the MoO 3 film an","au":["Ling Zhou","Zhixi Guan","Lin Yang","Daying Guo","Lianhui Wu","Xi'an Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"通过等离子体增强原子层沉积构建导电 MoO x 薄膜","zb":"通过热原子层沉积 (T‐ALD) 和等离子体增强原子层沉积 (PE‐ALD) 构建非晶态氧化钼薄膜。通过薄膜生长定律、原子力显微镜、扫描电子显微镜等方法系统地比较了两种方法制备的氧化钼薄膜的物理和化学性质。结果表明，两种 ALD 方法制备的非晶态氧化钼物理相均为 MoO 3 。与 T‐ALD MoO 3 相比，PE‐ALD 制备的 MoO 3 薄膜的生长速率更高。与 PE‐ALD MoO 3 相比，T‐ALD 制备的 MoO 3 薄膜没有出现成核延迟到层状生长模式，导致沉积薄膜更光滑，含有的杂质碳更少。PE‐ALD 制备的 MoO 3 含有 7.4% 的杂质碳。这种碳掺杂薄膜显著提高了 MoO 3 薄膜的导电性，并显示出良好的电化学活性。如预期所示，PE‐ALD 制备的 MoO 3 薄膜显示出良好的电催化析氧反应。在 10 mA cm −2 时过电位仅为 259 mV，并持续 60 h 析","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.4c04023","t":"Screening of Intermetallic Compounds Based on Intermediate Adsorption Equilibrium for Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.4c04023","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2024-07-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate (NO3-) reduction reaction (NO3RR) holds great potential for the conversion of NO3- contaminants into valuable NH3 in a sustainable method. Unfortunately, the nonequilibrium adsorption of intermediates and sluggish multielectron transfer have detrimental impacts on the electrocatalytic performance of the NO3RR, posing obstacles to its practical application. Herein, we initially screen the adsorption energies of three key intermediates, i.e., *NO3, *NO, and *H2O, along with the d-band centers on 21 types of transition metal (IIIV and IB)-Sb/Bi-based intermetallic compounds (IMCs) as electrocatalysts. The results reveal that hexagonal CoSb IMCs possess the optimal adsorption equilibrium for key intermediates and exhibit outstanding electrocatalytic NO3RR performance with a Faradaic efficiency of 96.3%, a NH3 selectivity of 89.1%, and excellent stability, surpassing ","au":["Chaoqun Ma","Huaifang Zhang","Jing Xia","Xiaojuan Zhu","Kaiyu Qu","Fukai Feng"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"基于中间体吸附平衡筛选用于电催化硝酸盐还原为氨的金属间化合物","zb":"电催化硝酸盐（NO3-）还原反应（NO3RR）在可持续方法中将 NO3- 污染物转化为有价值的 NH3 方面具有巨大潜力。不幸的是，中间体的非平衡吸附和缓慢的多电子转移对 NO3RR 的电催化性能有不利影响，阻碍了其实际应用。在这里，我们最初筛选了 21 种过渡金属（IIIV 和 IB）-Sb/Bi 基金属间化合物（IMCs）作为电催化剂的三个关键中间体的吸附能，即 *NO3、*NO 和 *H2O，以及 d 带中心。结果表明，六方 CoSb IMCs 具有关键中间体的最佳吸附平衡，并表现出卓越的电催化 NO3RR 性能，法拉第效率为 96.3%，氨选择性为 89.1%，并具有优异的稳定性，超过最近报道的大多数 NO3RR 电催化剂。此外，将 CoSb IMCs/C 集成到一个新型 Zn-NO3- 电池中，产生了 11.88 mW cm-2 的高功率密度。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.23919/acc60939.2024.10644317","t":"Learning-based Model Predictive Control of an Ammonia Synthesis Reactor","u":"https://doi.org/10.23919/acc60939.2024.10644317","s":"2024 American Control Conference (ACC)","d":"2024-07-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"We investigate the application of state-of-the-art recurrent machine learning methods to tackle the computational challenges associated with the real-time solvability of a packed-bed ammonia synthesis reactor model for optimal control design. A high-fidelity multi-physics model is developed for the ammonia reactor by integrating reaction kinetics and complex transport phenomena. The model involves a system of interconnected algebraic, ordinary, and partial differential equations, providing a deeper understanding and improved prediction accuracy of pressure, temperature, and species concentration dynamics. However, due to its computational complexity, the resulting model is unsuitable for optimal control applications such as model predictive control (MPC). To overcome this limitation, we create a reduced-order model based on long short-term memory (LSTM) using time series data generated f","au":["Thiago O. Cabral","Amirsalar Bagheri","Davood B. Pourkargar"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"基于机器学习的模型预测控制用于氨合成反应器","zb":"研究将最先进的循环机器学习方法应用于解决填充床氨合成反应器模型在实时可解性方面的计算挑战，以进行最优控制设计。开发了一个高保真多物理模型用于氨合成反应器，通过结合反应动力学和复杂的传输现象。该模型涉及一个由相互关联的代数、常微分和偏微分方程组成的系统，提供对压力、温度和物种浓度动力学的更深入理解和更高的预测精度。然而，由于其计算复杂性，得到的模型不适合最优控制应用，如模型预测控制（MPC）。为克服此限制，我们基于长短期记忆（LSTM）创建了一个降阶模型，使用从离线模拟过程输出生成的时间序列数据。该代理模型有效地捕捉了系统的非线性动力学，使MPC的成功实施和最优闭环性能成为可能。"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.nanolett.4c02127","t":"Theoretical Insights into the Selectivity of Nitrite Reduction to NH 2 OH on Single-Atom Catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.nanolett.4c02127","s":"Nano Letters","d":"2024-07-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electroreduction of nitrate/nitrite to high-value-added products, including NH2OH, is an important way to achieve sustainable production of green energy. However, this electrosynthesis of NH2OH still suffers from poor selectivity due to the various competing reactions. Here, we screen out Ni-N4 and Cu-N4 catalysts for highly efficient nitrite electroreduction to NH2OH by adopting density functional theory (DFT) calculations. DFT calculations reveal that the high selectivity of Ni-N4 and Cu-N4 is ascribed to their weak adsorption of *NH2OH and *NH intermediates, thereby preventing the further reduction of NH2OH. Moreover, using *NO as a model intermediate, we studied the relationship between the 3d orbital occupancy and adsorption strength of the intermediate. It is found that Ni-N4 and Cu-N4 with fully occupied dxz, dyz, and dz2 orbitals have poor adsorption of *NO intermediate. This wor","au":["Wei Zheng","Dingge Fan","Yang Yang","Qianwang Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrite Reduction"],"zt":"关于单原子催化剂上亚硝酸还原为 NH 2 OH 选择性的理论见解","zb":"硝酸盐/亚硝酸盐电还原为高附加值产品，包括 NH2OH，是实现绿色能源可持续生产的重要途径。然而，这种 NH2OH 的电合成仍然由于各种竞争反应而选择性差。在这里，我们通过采用密度泛函理论（DFT）计算筛选出 Ni-N4 和 Cu-N4 催化剂，用于高效亚硝酸电还原为 NH2OH。DFT 计算表明，Ni-N4 和 Cu-N4 的高选择性归因于它们对 *NH2OH 和 *NH 中间体的弱吸附，从而防止了 NH2OH 的进一步还原。此外，使用 *NO 作为模型中间体，我们研究了 3d 轨道占位与中间体吸附强度之间的关系。发现 Ni-N4 和 Cu-N4 具有完全占位的 dxz、dyz 和 dz2 轨道，对 *NO 中间体的吸附差。这项工作为 NH2OH 合成提供了一条新途径，并为决定催化选择性的关键因素提供了视角。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.nanolett.4c01904","t":"Interface Engineering of the Cu 1.5 Mn 1.5 O 4 /CeO 2 Heterostructure for Highly Efficient Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.nanolett.4c01904","s":"Nano Letters","d":"2024-07-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) is considered a sustainable technology to convert the nitrate pollutants to ammonia. However, developing highly efficient electrocatalysts is necessary and challenging given the slow kinetics of the NO3RR with an eight-electron transfer process. Here, a Cu1.5Mn1.5O4 (CMO)/CeO2 heterostructure with rich interfaces is designed and fabricated through an electrospinning and postprocessing technique. Benefiting from the strong coupling between CMO and CeO2, the optimized CMO/CeO2-2 catalyst presents excellent NO3RR performance, with NH3 Faraday efficiency (FE) up to 93.07 ± 1.45% at -0.481 V vs reversible hydrogen electrode (RHE) and NH3 yield rate up to 48.06 ± 1.32 mg cm-2 h-1 at -0.681 V vs RHE. Theoretical calculations demonstrate that the integration of CeO2 with CMO modulates the adsorption/desorption process of the reactants and in","au":["Ruikai Qi","Linfeng Zhang","Siyu Ren","Bingyan Shi","Mengxiao Zhong","Zheng-jie Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"Cu 1.5 Mn 1.5 O 4 /CeO 2 异质结构的界面工程用于高效电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"电化学硝酸盐还原反应（NO3RR）被认为是一种可持续的技术，可以将硝酸盐污染物转化为氨。然而，鉴于 NO3RR 的动力学缓慢，涉及八电子转移过程，开发高效电催化剂是必要且具有挑战性的。在这里，通过静电纺丝和后处理技术设计和制备了具有丰富界面的 Cu1.5Mn1.5O4 (CMO)/CeO2 异质结构。受益于 CMO 和 CeO2 之间的强耦合，优化的 CMO/CeO2-2 催化剂表现出优异的 NO3RR 性能，在 -0.481 V vs 可逆氢电极（RHE）下 NH3 法拉第效率（FE）高达 93.07 ± 1.45%，在 -0.681 V vs RHE 下 NH3 产率高达 48.06 ± 1.32 mg cm-2 h-1。理论计算表明，CeO2 与 CMO 的结合调节了反应物和中间体的吸附/解吸过程，在 NO* 到 N* 的速率决定步骤中显示了降低的能量势垒，实现了卓越的 NO3RR ","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202404525","t":"Insight into Fluoride Additives to Enhance Ammonia Production from Lithium‐Mediated Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202404525","s":"Small","d":"2024-07-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Demands for green ammonia production increase due to its application as a proton carrier, and recent achievements in electrochemical Li‐mediated nitrogen reduction reactions (Li‐NRRs) show promising reliability. Here, it is demonstrated that F‐containing additives in the electrolyte improve ammonia production by modulating the solid electrolyte interphase (SEI). It is suggested that the anionic additives with low lowest unoccupied molecular orbital levels enhance efficiency by contributing to the formation of a conductive SEI incorporated with LiF. Specifically, as little as 0.3 wt.% of BF 4 − additive to the electrolyte, the Faradaic efficiency (FE) for ammonia production is enhanced by over 15% compared to an additive‐free electrolyte, achieving a high yield of 161 ± 3 nmol s −1 cm −2 . The BF 4 − additive exhibits advantages, with decreased overpotential and improved FE, comp","au":["Dongwoo Shin","Yeongbae Jeon","Vy Thuy Nguyen","Shinmyeong Kang","Yewon Hong","Chaeeun Lim"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"关于氟添加剂增强锂介导电化学氮还原反应制氨的见解","zb":"由于氟化物作为质子载体的应用，对绿色氨生产的需要增加，最近在锂介导的氮还原反应（Li-NRRs）方面的成就显示出有希望的可靠性。这里，证明了电解质中的含氟添加剂通过调节固体电解质界面（SEI）提高了氨的产量。建议具有最低空分子轨道能级低的阴离子添加剂通过有助于形成含有 LiF 的导电 SEI 来提高效率。具体而言，电解质中添加 0.3 wt.% 的 BF4- 添加剂，与添加剂-free 电解质相比，氨生产的法拉第效率（FE）提高了 15% 以上，实现了 161 ± 3 nmol s −1 cm −2 的高产率。与作为主体电解质使用相比，BF4- 添加剂具有降低过电位和提高 FE 的优点。Li3N 上层的观察表明，最外层的 SEI 上正在发生活性 Li-NRR 催化循环，密度泛函理论模拟提出，含有 LiF 的 SEI 通过调整中间体的结合能来促进质子化的能级，与裸铜相比。这项研究解锁了添加剂","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s10750-024-05626-y","t":"Development and application of an algae multi-metric index to inform ecologically relevant nitrogen reduction targets","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10750-024-05626-y","s":"Hydrobiologia","d":"2024-07-09","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Scott L. Rollins","Charles Ritz","Pam Krone","R. Jan Stevenson","Yangdong Pan","Nadia Gillett"],"o":"回填","zt":"用于指导生态相关氮减排目标的藻类多指标指数开发与应用","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202409019","t":"Efficient Electrosynthesis of Urea over Single‐Atom Alloy with Electronic Metal Support Interaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202409019","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2024-07-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract Urea electrosynthesis from carbon dioxide (CO 2 ) and nitrate (NO 3 − ) is an alternative approach to traditional energy‐intensive urea synthesis technology. Herein, we report a CuAu single‐atom alloy (SAA) with electronic metal support interaction (EMSI), achieving a high urea yield rate of 813.6 μg h −1 mg cat −1 at −0.94 V versus reversible hydrogen electrode (vs. RHE) and a Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 45.2 % at −0.74 V vs. RHE. In situ experiments and theoretical calculations demonstrated that single‐atom Cu sites modulate the adsorption behavior of intermediate species. Bimetallic sites synergistically accelerate C−N bond formation through spontaneous coupling of *CO and *NO to form *ONCO as key intermediates. More importantly, electronic metal support interaction between CuAu SAA and CeO 2 carrier further modulates electron structure and interfacial microenvironment, endow","au":["Peng Zhan","Jinjie Zhuang","Shuai Yang","Xuechun Li","Xuehan Chen","Tian Wen"],"o":"回填","zt":"单原子合金电子金属载体相互作用高效尿素电合成","zb":"报道了一种具有电子金属载体相互作用（EMSI）的CuAu单原子合金（SAA），在-0.94 V vs. RHE时尿素产率率为813.6 μg h −1 mg cat −1，在-0.74 V vs. RHE时法拉第效率（FE）为45.2%。原位实验和理论计算表明，单原子Cu位点调节了中间物种的吸附行为。双金属位点通过*CO和*NO的自发耦合形成*ONCO作为关键中间体，协同加速C−N键形成。更重要的是，CuAu SAA和CeO 2载体之间的电子金属载体相互作用进一步调节了电子结构和界面微环境，赋予电催化剂优异的活性和耐久性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.69997/sct.188791","t":"Technoeconomic Analysis of Chemical Looping Ammonia Synthesis Reactors to Enable Green Ammonia Production","u":"https://doi.org/10.69997/sct.188791","s":"Systems and Control Transactions","d":"2024-07-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Chemical looping ammonia synthesis (CLAS) is a new ammonia synthesis method capable of efficiently synthesizing ammonia at atmospheric pressure. The low-pressure operation of CLAS systems could decrease the capital and operational costs of ammonia synthesis. Despite its early developmental stage, the use of standard process engineering equipment in CLAS makes it possible to reasonably assess its economic potential. In this study, we evaluated the technoeconomic potential of CLAS systems in comparison to a Haber-Bosch (HB) synthesis process in the context of green ammonia production. CLAS is more compatible with the separate nitrogen and hydrogen feedstocks used in green ammonia production, and cost savings from CLAS could improve the economic viability of green ammonia production. Ammonia synthesis loops were modeled in Aspen Plus and the levelized cost of ammonia (LCOA) of each system w","au":["Laron D. Burrows","George M. Bollas"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"化学链氨合成反应器的技术经济分析以实现绿色氨生产","zb":"化学链氨合成（CLAS）是一种能够在大气压下高效合成氨的新方法。CLAS系统的低压运行可以降低氨合成的资本和运营成本。尽管处于早期发展阶段，但在CLAS中使用标准过程工程设备使其有可能合理评估其经济潜力。本研究评估了CLAS系统与哈伯-博施（HB）合成过程在绿色氨生产背景下的技术经济潜力。CLAS与绿色氨生产中使用的分离氮和氢原料更兼容，CLAS的成本节约可以提高绿色氨生产的经济可行性。在Aspen Plus中对氨合成循环进行了建模，并计算了每个系统的氨平准化成本（LCOA）。比较了三个CLAS系统；两个高温和一个低温化学链，与等效大小的传统HB系统。研究发现CLAS可以将合成成本降低90%，低温CLAS比高温CLAS更具经济可行性。高温CLAS中外部加热器的需要减少了由于低压运行而可能实现的任何成本节约。这项工作突出了CLAS降低氨合成成本的潜力，并强调了进一步开发低温CLAS系统的必要","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨"},{"id":"10.1039/d4nj02343a","t":"Electrodeposition of a 3D dendritic Cu–Sn bimetallic alloy for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d4nj02343a","s":"New Journal of Chemistry","d":"2024-07-09","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Cu–Sn alloy attains an NH 3 yield rate and faraday efficiency up to 293.12 μmol h −1 cm −2 and 78.57% at −1.2 V versus reversible hydrogen electrode in 0.1 M Na 2 SO 4 (containing 0.01 M NaNO 3 ) electrolyte.","au":["Jinxiu Zhao","Jingyi Xu","Liyi Shi"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"用于电催化硝酸盐还原为氨的3D树枝状Cu–Sn双金属合金的电沉积","zb":"Cu–Sn合金在0.1 M Na 2 SO 4（含有0.01 M NaNO 3）电解质中在-1.2 V vs. 可逆氢电极下达到293.12 μmol h −1 cm −2的氨产率和78.57%的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202411816","t":"Inside Cover: Modulating the Electrolyte Microenvironment in Electrical Double Layer for Boosting Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia (Angew. Chem. Int. Ed. 32/2024)","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202411816","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2024-07-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Rationally regulating the electrolyte microenvironment is an effective approach to boost the electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) performance. In their Research Article (e202408382), Xin-Yao Yu and co-workers propose a novel strategy to enhance the NO3RR performance by mediating alkali metal cations in the electrolyte. In the presence of K+, the protons are more favorable to cross the electric double layer to reach the catalyst surface and conversion of NO3− to NO2− is promoted, thereby favoring the overall kinetics of NO3RR.","au":["Weidong Wen","Shidong Fang","Yitong Zhou","Ying Zhao","Peng Li","Xin‐Yao Yu"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"调节电双层电解质微环境以增强电催化硝酸盐还原为氨（Angew. Chem. Int. Ed. 32/2024）","zb":"合理调节电解质微环境是提高电催化硝酸盐还原反应（NO3RR）性能的有效方法。在他们的研究文章（e202408382）中，Xin-Yao Yu及其同事提出了一种通过介导电解质中的碱金属阳离子来增强NO3RR性能的新策略。在K+存在下，质子更倾向于穿过电双层到达催化剂表面，并且NO3−到NO2−的转化被促进，从而有利于NO3RR的整体动力学。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.4c02633","t":"High-Rate, High-Selectivity Electrochemical Oxidation of Ammonia to Nitrite with a Silver-Based Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.4c02633","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2024-07-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Effective operation of electrocatalysts for the ammonia oxidation reaction (AOR) is typically constrained by poisoning, rapid corrosion, and low Faradaic efficiencies (FEs). Aiming to address these challenges, we present herein a robust silver oxide (AgO x ) catalyst generated by in situ anodic electrodeposition from a solution of Tollen’s reagent ([Ag(NH 3 ) 2 ]OH). When tested in 1 M KOH and 0.1 M NH 3 at 1.1 V vs standard hydrogen electrode, AgO x catalyzes the AOR to nitrite at an FE of 70 ± 6% and a yield rate of 42 ± 7 nmol s –1 cm –2, on a time scale of 33 h, which is the highest performance reported so far. Our data suggest that the mechanism of the AgO x -catalyzed AOR is defined by pH, with the strongly alkaline conditions (>0.1 M KOH) favoring the heterogeneous electrocatalytic pathway producing nitrite. In turn, operation at <0.1 M KOH promotes the formation of N 2 via a homo","au":["Thi Mung Vu","Sam Johnston","Darcy Simondson","Cuong K. Nguyen","Tam D. Nguyen","Daniel Van Zeil"],"o":"回填","zt":"基于银的催化剂在碱性介质中实现高选择性、高效率的电化学氨氧化制备亚硝酸","zb":"研究对象为氨氧化反应（AOR），采用原位阳极电沉积法制备银氧化物（AgO x ）催化剂，在 1 M KOH 和 0.1 M NH 3 中以 1.1 V vs 标准氢电极进行测试，表现出 70 ± 6% 的法拉第效率（FE）和 42 ± 7 nmol s –1 cm –2 的产率速率，运行 33 小时，是目前报道的最高性能。电化学和物理表征表明 Ag 3+ 是促进亚硝酸生成的活性位点，强碱性条件 (>0.1 M KOH) 有利于非均相电催化路径生成亚硝酸，而 <0.1 M KOH 条件下则通过 Ag 3+/2+ 氧化还原偶联促进均相反应生成 N 2。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1007/s10562-024-04772-1","t":"Effective Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction through π Back-donation Process in Mn3+ of Mn-doped g-C3N4","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10562-024-04772-1","s":"Catalysis Letters","d":"2024-07-08","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yijin Ma","Yinpeng Lu","Chang Li","Liangqing Hu","Hexin Zhang","Jing Feng"],"o":"回填","why":["Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction"],"zt":"通过Mn掺杂g-C3N4中Mn3+的π背电子转移过程实现有效的电化学氮还原","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-024-50035-3","t":"Recycling polyolefin plastic waste at short contact times via rapid joule heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-024-50035-3","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2024-07-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"Abstract The chemical deconstruction of polyolefins to fuels, lubricants, and waxes offers a promising strategy for mitigating their accumulation in landfills and the environment. Yet, achieving true recyclability of polyolefins into C 2 -C 4 monomers with high yields, low energy demand, and low carbon dioxide emissions under realistic polymer-to-catalyst ratios remains elusive. Here, we demonstrate a single-step electrified approach utilizing Rapid Joule Heating over an H-ZSM-5 catalyst to efficiently deconstruct polyolefin plastic waste into light olefins (C 2 -C 4 ) in milliseconds, with high productivity at much higher polymer-to-catalyst ratio than prior work. The catalyst is essential in producing a narrow distribution of light olefins. Pulsed operation and steam co-feeding enable highly selective deconstruction (product fraction of >90% towards C 2 -C 4 hydrocarbons) with minimal ","au":["Esun Selvam","Kewei Yu","Jacqueline Ngu","Sean Najmi","Dionisios G. Vlachos"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"通过快速焦耳加热在短接触时间内回收聚烯烃塑料废物","zb":"聚烯烃的化学分解为燃料、润滑剂和蜡提供了有前景的策略，以减轻其在垃圾填埋场和环境中的积累。然而，在现实聚合物与催化剂比例下，以高收率、低能耗和低二氧化碳排放实现聚烯烃真正可回收性为 C 2 -C 4 单体仍然难以实现。这里，我们展示了一种单步通电方法，利用快速焦耳加热在 H-ZSM-5 催化剂上有效地分解聚烯烃塑料废物为轻烯烃 (C 2 -C 4 )，在毫秒内实现高生产力，并且聚合物与催化剂比例远高于先前工作。该催化剂对于产生窄分布的轻烯烃至关重要。脉冲操作和蒸汽共进料实现了高度选择性的分解（产品分数对 C 2 -C 4 烃 >90%），与连续焦耳加热相比，催化剂失活最小。这种实验室规模方法展示了有效分解实际废物材料的能力，对添加剂和杂质的抵抗力，以及循环聚烯烃塑料废物管理的多功能性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","top":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2024-p9ntc","t":"How Ir-Rh Alloys Improve Electrochemical Ammonia Oxidation Activity Studied by Density Functional Theory","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2024-p9ntc","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2024-07-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electrochemical ammonia oxidation reaction (AOR) has applications in hydrogen storage and ammonia waste remediation. Using density functional theory, we investigate the mechanism of AOR on Ir, Rh, and their alloys at varied atomic ratios Ir75Rh25, Ir50Rh50, and Ir25Rh75 towards N2(g), NO2–(aq) and NO3–(aq) formation. This work introduces a method for computational alloy design by considering both electronic energy and configurational entropy. The structures considered are selective to N2(g) formation and all favoured *N-N coupling. An Ir50Rh50 alloy was found to reduce the theoretical onset potential for N2(g) formation relative to pure Ir while not exhibiting a downhill coupling step corresponding to catalyst poisoning by *N as shown for pure Rh, consistent with previous experimental work. The formation of NO2–(aq) and NO3–(aq) demand significantly higher potentials, typically limit","au":["Brendan Laframboise","Shayne Johnston","Leanne Chen"],"o":"回填","zt":"密度泛函理论研究铱-铑合金对电化学氨氧化活性的提升机制","zb":"研究对象为电化学氨氧化反应（AOR），采用密度泛函理论计算 Ir、Rh 及其合金（Ir75Rh25、Ir50Rh50、Ir25Rh75）在 N 2(g)、NO 2–(aq) 和 NO 3–(aq) 形成过程中的机理。研究发现 Ir50Rh50 合金降低了 N 2(g) 形成的理论起始电位，且不表现出纯 Rh 催化剂中毒的 *N 滑动耦合步骤，与实验结果一致。NO 2–(aq) 和 NO 3–(aq) 的形成需要更高电位，通常受最终羟基化步骤控制。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1007/s10934-024-01652-2","t":"In-situ synthesis of porous silica-ruthenium composite catalyst for hydrolysis of ammonia borane","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10934-024-01652-2","s":"Journal of Porous Materials","d":"2024-07-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Tetsuo Umegaki","Haruhiro Imai","Qiang Xu","Yoshiyuki Kojima"],"o":"回填","zt":"多孔二氧化硅-钌复合催化剂的原位合成及其在氨硼烷水解中的应用","ob":"氨硼烷水解；涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.4885300","t":"Solar-Driven Nitrogen Fixation with Zn/Al-Mofs Under Mild Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.4885300","s":"SSRN","d":"2024-07-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["can sun","Qiang Sun","Shouxin Zhu","Zijie Fang","Jingyi Qu","Zhexiao Zhu"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrogen Fixation"],"zt":"在温和条件下使用 Zn/Al-Mofs 进行太阳能驱动氮固定","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.20517/cs.2023.74","t":"Crystal facet engineering of electrocatalysts for nitrate reduction to ammonia: recent advances and future perspectives","u":"https://doi.org/10.20517/cs.2023.74","s":"Chemical Synthesis","d":"2024-07-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia (NH3) is an important chemical feedstock and a clean energy carrier that has a pivotal impact on the sustainable energy circle. Its electrocatalytic production is evolving into a green alternative to the traditional Haber-Bosch process. A key strategy in enhancing the performance of this electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis is crystal facet engineering of electrocatalysts, which could significantly influence the reaction mechanism, kinetics, and thermodynamics. This review summarizes the recent advancements in crystal facet engineering for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia. Through this review, we hope to shed light on the significant role of crystal facet engineering in advancing electrocatalytic ammonia production and provide useful guidance on the design of high-performance electrocatalysts.","au":["Yuwei Zhang","Hanfeng Liang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"电催化剂的晶体 facet 工程化用于硝酸盐还原为氨：最近进展和未来展望","zb":"氨 (NH3) 是一种重要的化学原料和清洁能源载体，对可持续能源循环具有关键影响。其电催化生产正在成为传统哈伯-博施过程的绿色替代方案。增强这种电催化氨合成性能的关键策略是电催化剂的晶体 facet 工程化，这可以显著影响反应机理、动力学和热力学。本综述总结了电催化硝酸盐还原为氨的晶体 facet 工程化的最新进展。通过本综述，我们希望阐明晶体 facet 工程化在推进电催化氨生产中的重要作用，并为高性能电催化剂的设计提供有用指导。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1038/s44221-024-00278-7","t":"Highly efficient metal-free nitrate reduction enabled by electrified membrane filtration","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s44221-024-00278-7","s":"Nature Water","d":"2024-07-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Current methods for electrocatalytic destruction of nitrate in drinking water require metal catalysts to achieve sufficient nitrate removal. However, metal-based catalysts involve complicated synthesis, increase treatment costs and can lead to leaching of metals into treated water. Here we achieved nitrate reduction performance comparable to that of metal-based catalysts via electrofiltration through a metal-free nanoporous electrified membrane (EM) containing unmodified pristine carbon nanotubes (CNTs). Experimental results coupled with computational fluid dynamics simulations elucidated how the decreased diffusion boundary layer in the flow-through CNT-EM mitigates diffusion limitations to enhance overall nitrate reaction activity. Furthermore, defects in CNTs were identified as the catalytic active sites by comparing the activity of EMs containing acid-treated metal-free CNTs and CNTs","au":["Yingzheng Fan","Xiaoxiong Wang","Claire Butler","Amma Kankam","Abdessamad Belgada","Julia Simon"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"通过电驱动膜过滤实现高效无金属硝酸盐还原","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐降解，采用无金属纳米多孔电驱动膜（EM）含未改性碳纳米管（CNTs）进行电过滤。实验结合计算流体动力学模拟表明，CNT-EM 中扩散边界层减小缓解了扩散限制，提高了硝酸盐反应活性。酸处理 CNTs 的 EM 活性低于含缺陷 CNTs 的 EM，表明缺陷为活性位点。密度泛函理论和分子动力学计算显示，缺陷位点的 *NO 2 和 *NO 吸附能增强，使硝酸盐离子在流动操作下更易接近。长期稳定性、抗环境干扰和满足饮用水标准的硝酸盐去除及规模化应用在真实地表水中得到验证，展示了无金属 CNT-EM 的优异性能。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s10853-024-09966-x","t":"Highly selective electrochemical reduction of nitrate-to-ammonia using iron phosphide self-supported electrode","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10853-024-09966-x","s":"Journal of Materials Science","d":"2024-07-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mingye Ren","Ting He","Shihao Han","Jingbin Hu","Feng Xiao","Pan Gao"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"磷化铁自支撑电极在电化学中将硝酸盐还原为氨的高选择性研究","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.18573/jae.33","t":"An Indirect Ammonia Fuelled Solid-Oxide Fuel Cell System with free cracking from Waste Heat","u":"https://doi.org/10.18573/jae.33","s":"Journal of Ammonia Energy","d":"2024-07-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"A 100W scale indirect ammonia solid oxide fuel cell (IA-SOFC) system called REACH was designed, built and tested at the Rutherford Appleton Laboratory, with an off-the-shelf 100W solid oxide fuel cell at its core. IA-SOFCs with thermal integration of cracking have been modelled at a large scale, and there have been single cell studies focusing on the degradation and NOx emissions while running on ammonia. REACH addresses the gap of demonstrating an integrated system and only a few stack-scale demonstrators to have been tested in academia. The purpose of this work was to present an engineering design that demonstrates the practical possibilities of using the waste heat from high-temperature SOFCs to perform ammonia cracking, and to demonstrate a real-world efficiency of above 45% for such a system. Tests were conducted in a fume hood with gaseous supplies of air and ammonia. The start-up ","au":["Benjamin Matthew Peters","Adam Huddart","Richard Cowan","Jayke Smith","Tristan Davenne"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia cracking"],"zt":"一个间接氨燃料固体氧化物燃料电池系统，从废热中自由裂解","zb":"设计、建造和测试了在拉夫伯勒实验室的 100W 规模间接氨固体氧化物燃料电池 (IA-SOFC) 系统 REACH，其核心是现成的 100W 固体氧化物燃料电池。研究了热集成裂解的 IA-SOFC，并在氨运行时进行了单电池研究，重点关注降解和 NOx 排放。REACH 解决了展示集成系统的差距，并且只有少数堆栈规模演示器在学术界进行了测试。这项工作的目的是展示一个工程设计，证明使用高温 SOFC 的废热来执行氨裂解的实用可能性，并展示该系统的实际效率超过 45%。在通风橱中进行了测试，使用空气和氨的气体供应。启动测试证明所提出的设计能够进行自热裂解。燃料电池的性能映射，即在不同空气-燃料比下扫掠燃料速率，揭示了系统效率为 14%。经诊断，这是由于现成的 SOFC 在其预期工作条件下燃料利用率低，这可能是由于供应商的阳极还原过程造成的。这表明可靠的 SOFC 堆栈的商业可用性可能是该领域研究","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.langmuir.4c00951","t":"Density Functional Theory Investigation on the Nitrogen Reduction Mechanism in Two-Dimensional Transition-Metal Boride with Ordered Metal Vacancies","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.langmuir.4c00951","s":"Langmuir","d":"2024-07-04","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The creation of ordered collective vacancies in experiment proves challenging within a two-dimensional lattice, resulting in a limited understanding of their impact on catalyst performance. Motivated by the successful experimental synthesis of monolayer molybdenum borides with precisely ordered metal vacancies [Zhou et al. Science 2021, 373, 801-805] through dealloying, the nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) in monolayer borides was systematically investigated to elucidate the influence of such ordered metal vacancies on catalytic reactions and the underlying mechanisms. The results reveal that the N-containing intermediates tend to dissociate, facilitating the NRR process with reduced UL. The emergence of ordered metal vacancies modulates the electronic properties of the catalyst and partially facilitates the decomposition of N-containing intermediates. However, the UL for NRR in Mo4/3B2","au":["Linghuan Ma","Xianfei Chen","Yi Huang","Peicong Zhang","Beibei Xiao"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"二维过渡金属硼化物中有序金属空位的氮还原机理密度泛函理论研究","zb":"研究对象为氮还原反应（NRR），采用密度泛函理论研究单层硼化钼和硼化钨中有序金属空位对催化反应和机理的影响。结果表明 N 含量中间体倾向于解离，促进 NRR 过程，有序金属空位调节催化剂的电子性质并部分促进 N 含量中间体分解。Mo 4/3B 2 和 W 4/3B 2 的 NRR 负载电位（UL）显著增加，电化学性能下降可通过 d-p 带中心（ΔdM-pB）电子描述符解释。Mo 4/3Sc 2/3B 2 表现出最优催化活性（UL -0.5 V）和优于析氢反应（HER）的 NRR 选择性。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1109/icipcn63822.2024.00139","t":"Modeling & Controller Design for Ammonia Production Plant","u":"https://doi.org/10.1109/icipcn63822.2024.00139","s":"2024 5th International Conference on Image Processing and Capsule Networks (ICIPCN)","d":"2024-07-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Precise control is required ensuring optimal performance and the quality of product in the chemical industry that produces ammonia. This study focuses on designing a control system for Ammonia production process based on a Haber-Bosch process. The primary objective of this research study is to maintain the produced Ammonia concentration at a given level. For designing the control system, a First Order Plus Dead Time (FOPDT) model has been utilized, the model gets hydrogen flow rate as input, and the resultant Ammonia concentration as output. First of all, the stability analysis of this FOPDT model has been conducted with the help of Nyquist plot, Nichols diagram, and Bode diagram. Two different control systems have been established for this model in MATLAB, one is done by using the ordinary PI controller, and the other one is by using the PI controller with Smith predictor, which compens","au":["Sandeep Kumar Sunori","Mehul Manu","Pradeep Juneja"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"氨生产工厂的建模与控制器设计","zb":"基于哈伯-博施过程，利用一阶加纯滞后（FOPDT）模型设计氨生产控制系统，比较了普通 PI 控制器与带 Smith 预测器的 PI 控制器。通过稳定性分析和频率响应评估，结果表明 Smith 预测器能有效补偿死时，提高系统稳定性和效率。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1002/advs.202405188","t":"Unraveling the Role of the Stoichiometry of Atomic Layer Deposited Nickel Cobalt Oxides on the Oxygen Evolution Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/advs.202405188","s":"Advanced Science","d":"2024-07-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Nickel cobalt oxides (NCOs) are promising, non‐precious oxygen evolution reaction (OER) electrocatalysts. However, the stoichiometry‐dependent electrochemical behavior makes it crucial to understand the structure‐OER relationship. In this work, NCO thin film model systems are prepared using atomic layer deposition. In‐depth film characterization shows the phase transition from Ni‐rich rock‐salt films to Co‐rich spinel films. Electrochemical analysis in 1 m KOH reveals a synergistic effect between Co and Ni with optimal performance for the 30 at.% Co film after 500 CV cycles. Electrochemical activation correlates with film composition, specifically increasing activation is observed for more Ni‐rich films as its bulk transitions to the active (oxy)hydroxide phase. In parallel to this transition, the electrochemical surface area (ECSA) increases up to a factor 8. Using an original ","au":["Renée T. M. van Limpt","Mengmeng Lao","Mihalis N. Tsampas","Mariadriana Creatore"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积镍钴氧化物化学计量比对析氧反应的作用解析","zb":"镍钴氧化物 (NCOs) 是有潜力的非贵金属析氧反应 (OER) 电催化剂。本研究使用原子层沉积制备 NCO 薄膜模型体系，深入表征显示相变从富 Ni 矿物盐膜到富 Co 立方体相膜。在 1 m KOH 中电化学分析显示 Co 和 Ni 存在协同效应，经过 500 次循环伏安后 30 at.% Co 薄膜性能最佳。电化学激活与膜组成相关，富 Ni 薄膜激活增强，其体相转变为活性 (氢)氧化物相。同时电化学表面积 (ECSA) 增加至 8 倍。通过独特方法将 ECSA 变化与固有 OER 活性解耦，得出 70 at.% Co 立方体相 NCO 薄膜具有最高活性。研究表明 OER 机制依赖于化学组成：富 Co 立方体相薄膜表现出即时高活性，而富 Ni 矿物盐膜需要长时间激活以增加 ECSA 和 OER 性能。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsmaterialslett.4c00652","t":"Alumina-Titania Nanolaminate Condensers for Hot Programmable Catalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsmaterialslett.4c00652","s":"ACS Materials Letters","d":"2024-07-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"For programmable catalysis applications, nanolaminates composed of thin alternating layers of alumina and titania (ATO) were engineered using atomic layer deposition (ALD) as the dielectric material for a Pt-on-carbon catalytic condenser. Systematic investigation assessed synthesis parameters such as deposition temperature, alumina and titania layer thicknesses, the total number of layers (and interfaces), and the presence of a capping alumina layer on the maximum achievable charge accumulation in the Pt catalyst layer. The highest capacitance ATO configuration demonstrated a specific capacitance of ~1,200 nF/cm2 with working voltages of ±5 V, enabling the storage of 4×10^13 electrons or holes per cm2 at room temperature. Adsorption of carbon monoxide on the Pt/C-ATO device characterized by grazing incidence infrared spectroscopy showed changes in the surface binding energy of 13.1 ± 0.8","au":["Kyung-Ryul Oh","Amber Walton","Jason A. Chalmers","Justin A. Hopkins","Jesse R. Canavan","Tzia Ming Onn"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"氧化铝-二氧化钛纳米叠层电容器用于热可编程催化","zb":"使用原子层沉积 (ALD) 工程了氧化铝和二氧化钛 (ATO) 纳米叠层，作为 Pt-碳催化电容器中的介电材料用于可编程催化应用。系统研究评估了沉积温度、氧化铝和二氧化钛层厚度、层数和界面总数以及覆盖氧化铝层对 Pt 催化剂层最大电荷积累的影响。最高电容 ATO 结构比表面积为 ~1200 nF/cm2，工作电压为 ±5 V，在室温下可在每平方厘米存储 4×10^13 个电子或空穴。使用掠射红外光谱表征了 Pt/C-ATO 设备上吸附的一氧化碳，显示在外加电压偏置 ±1 V 时表面结合能变化为 13.1 ± 0.8 kJ/mol。结果加深了对纳米叠层结构的理解，并提供了一种增加电荷凝结强度的方法，适用于更高温度的表面化学。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积","pp":"ChemRxiv"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202400892","t":"Ultra‐Small High‐Entropy Alloy as Multi‐Functional Catalyst for Ammonia Based Fuel Cells","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202400892","s":"Small","d":"2024-07-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia fuel cells using carbon‐neutral ammonia as fuel are regarded as a fast, furious, and flexible next‐generation carbon‐free energy conversion technology, but it is limited by the kinetically sluggish ammonia oxidation reaction (AOR), oxygen reduction reaction (ORR), and hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Platinum can efficiently drive these three types of reactions, but its scale‐up application is limited by its susceptibility to poisoning and high cost. In order to reduce the cost and alleviate poisoning, incorporating Pt with various metals proves to be an efficient and feasible strategy. Herein, PtFeCoNiIr/C trifunctional high‐entropy alloy (HEA) catalysts are prepared with uniform mixing and ultra‐small size of 2 ± 0.5 nm by Joule heating method. PtFeCoNiIr/C exhibits efficient performance in AOR ( J peak = 139.8 A g −1 PGM ), ORR ( E 1/2 = 0.87 V), and HER ( E 10 = 20","au":["Yuanyuan Zhang","Zumin Wang","Lei Wang","Lingbo Zong"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"超小高熵合金作为氨基燃料电池多功能催化剂","zb":"使用碳中性氨作为燃料的氨燃料电池被视为下一代无碳能源转换技术，但受限于氨氧化反应 (AOR)、氧还原反应 (ORR) 和析氢反应 (HER) 的动力学迟缓。Pt 可有效驱动这三种反应，但其规模化应用受限于易中毒和高成本。为降低成本和减轻中毒，将 Pt 与多种金属结合被证明是高效可行的策略。本研究制备了 PtFeCoNiIr/C 高熵合金 (HEA) 催化剂，具有均匀混合和 2 ± 0.5 nm 的超小尺寸，通过焦耳热法制备。PtFeCoNiIr/C 在 AOR (峰值电流密度 J 峰 = 139.8 A g −1 PGM)、ORR (半波电位 E 1/2 = 0.87 V) 和 HER (10 mA cm −2 电位 E 10 = 20.3 mV) 中表现出高效性能，优于基准 Pt/C，在 200 h 内 HER 性能无损失。抗中毒测试中 E 1/2 几乎不变，表明其在氨燃料电池中有应用前","ob":"析氢反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202408382","t":"Modulating the Electrolyte Microenvironment in Electrical Double Layer for Boosting Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202408382","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2024-07-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) is a promising approach to achieve remediation of nitrate‐polluted wastewater and sustainable production of ammonia. However, it is still restricted by the low activity, selectivity and Faraday efficiency for ammonia synthesis. Herein, we propose an effective strategy to modulate the electrolyte microenvironment in electrical double layer (EDL) by mediating alkali metal cations in the electrolyte to enhance the NO 3 RR performance. Taking bulk Cu as a model catalyst, the experimental study reveals that the NO 3 − ‐to‐NH 3 performance in different electrolytes follows the trend Li + <Cs + <Na + <K + . Theoretical studies illustrate that the proton transport rate in NO 3 RR and the activity of the rate‐determining step (NO 3 − to NO 2 − ) increase in the order Li + <Cs + <Na + <K + . The cation effects are also general for two t","au":["Weidong Wen","Shidong Fang","Yitong Zhou","Ying Zhao","Peng Li","Xin‐Yao Yu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"调节电双层电解质微环境以增强电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"电化学硝酸盐还原反应 (NO3RR) 是一种有前景的方法，可以实现硝酸盐污染废水的修复和氨的可持续生产。然而，它仍然受到氨合成活性、选择性和法拉第效率低的限制。在此，我们提出了一种有效策略，通过在电解质中调解碱金属阳离子来调节电双层 (EDL) 的电解质微环境，以增强 NO3RR 性能。以块状 Cu 为模型催化剂，实验研究表明，在不同电解质中的 NO3− ‐to‐NH3 性能遵循 Li + <Cs + <Na + <K + 的趋势。理论研究说明，NO3RR 中的质子传输速率和决速步骤 (NO3 − to NO 2 − ) 的活性按 Li + <Cs + <Na + <K + 的顺序增加。阳离子效应对两种典型纳米结构催化剂也适用，包括铜/黄铜矿和镍磷化物，实现近 100 % 的法拉第效率和超过 99 % 的 NO3 − 到 NH 3 转化。此外，我们证明，在含有 K + 的电解质中，铜/黄铜","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acs.est.4c02445","t":"Membraneless Electrochemical Synthesis Strategy toward Nitrate-to-Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.est.4c02445","s":"Environmental Science & Technology","d":"2024-07-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electroreduction of nitrate (NO3RR) to ammonia in membraneless electrolyzers is of great significance for reducing the cost and saving energy consumption. However, severe chemical crossover with side reactions makes it challenging to achieve ideal electrolysis. Herein, we propose a general strategy for efficient membraneless ammonia synthesis by screening NO3RR catalysts with inferior oxygen reduction activity and matching the counter electrode (CE) with good oxygen evolution activity while blocking anodic ammonia oxidation. Consequently, screening the available Co-Co system, the membraneless NO3--to-NH3 conversion performance was significantly higher than H-type cells using costly proton-exchange membranes. At 200 mA cm-2, the full-cell voltage of the membraneless system (∼2.5 V) is 4 V lower than that of the membrane system (∼6.5 V), and the savings are 61.4 kW h (or 56.9%) per 1 kg NH","au":["Yongguang Bu","Wenjing Yu","Qiang Yang","Wenkai Zhang","Qingyu Sun","Wensu Wu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"无膜电化学合成策略向硝酸盐到氨的转化","zb":"在无膜电解槽中将硝酸盐 (NO3RR) 还原为氨具有重要意义，可以降低成本和节省能源消耗。然而，严重的化学交叉和副反应使其难以实现理想的电解。在此，我们提出了一种通用的无膜氨合成策略，通过筛选 NO3RR 催化剂（氧还原活性差）并匹配具有良好氧析出活性的对电极 (CE)，同时阻挡阳极氨氧化，从而实现高效的膜外氨合成。因此，筛选可用的 Co-Co 系统，无膜 NO3--to-NH3 转化性能明显优于使用昂贵的质子交换膜的 H 型电池。在 200 mA cm-2 时，无膜系统的全电池电压 (∼2.5 V) 比膜系统 (∼6.5 V) 低 4 V，每生产 1 kg NH3 节省 61.4 kW h（或 56.9%）。精心设计的脉冲过程，诱导可逆的表面重构，在在工作电极处原位产生和恢复活性 Co(III) 物种，并在 CE 处形成有利的 Co3O4/CoOOH，进一步显著提高了 NO3--to-N","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s12598-024-02836-0","t":"Sp/sp 2 carbon ratio‐driven high‐throughput screening of electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction performance on transition metal single‐atom catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s12598-024-02836-0","s":"Rare Metals","d":"2024-07-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Single‐atom catalysts (SACs) have been widely utilized in electrochemical nitrogen reduction reactions (NRR) due to their high atomic utilization and selectivity. Owing to the unique sp/sp 2 co‐hybridization, graphyne materials can offer stable adsorption sites for single metal atoms. To investigate the influence of the sp/sp 2 hybrid carbon ratio on the electrocatalytic NRR performance of graphyne, a high‐throughput screening of 81 catalysts, with 27 transition metals loaded on graphyne (GY1), graphdiyne (GY2), and graphtriyne (GY3), was conducted using first‐principles calculations. The results of the screening revealed that Ti@GY3 exhibits the lowest energy barrier for the rate‐determining step (0.32 eV) in NRR. Further, to explore the impact of different sp/sp 2 ‐hybridized carbon ratios on the catalytic activity of SACs, the mechanism of nitrogen (N 2 ) adsorption, activati","au":["Ze‐Xiang Yin","Yu‐Dan Li","Yu‐Huan Ye","Yuan Liu","Mian‐Feng Li","Zi‐Jun Yang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"sp/sp 2 碳比例驱动的过渡金属单原子催化剂电催化氮还原性能的高通量筛选","zb":"单原子催化剂 (SACs) 由于其高原子利用率和选择性，已被广泛应用于电化学氮还原反应 (NRR)。由于独特的 sp/sp 2 共杂化，图炔材料可以提供稳定的单金属原子吸附位点。为了研究 sp/sp 2 杂合碳比对图炔电催化 NRR 性能的影响，使用第一性原理计算对 81 种催化剂进行了高通量筛选，其中 27 种过渡金属负载在图炔 (GY1)、图炔二炔 (GY2) 和图炔三炔 (GY3) 上。筛选结果揭示，Ti@GY3 在 NRR 中具有最低的决速步骤能垒 (0.32 eV)。此外，为了探索不同的 sp/sp 2 ‐杂化碳比对 SACs 催化活性的影响，系统地研究了氮 (N 2 ) 吸附、活化和 Ti@GY1、Ti@GY2 和 Ti@GY3 上 NRR 的综合途径。发现 sp/sp 2 ‐杂化碳的比例可以显著调节金属的 d ‐带中心，从而影响 NRR 中决速步骤的能量势垒，从 Ti@GY1","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/1945-7111/ad60f8","t":"Electrocatalytic Reduction of Nitrate to Ammonia at Oxidized Vanadium Surfaces with V(3 + ) and V(4 + ) Oxidation States","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/1945-7111/ad60f8","s":"Journal of The Electrochemical Society","d":"2024-07-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical reduction of nitrate to ammonia is of interest as an energy/environmentally friendly source of ammonia for agriculture and energy applications and as a route toward groundwater purification. We report in situ photoemission data, electrochemical results, and density functional theory calculations that demonstrate vanadium oxide—prepared by ambient exposure of V metal, with a distribution of surface V 3+ and V 4+ oxidation states—specifically adsorbs and reduces nitrate to ammonia at pH 3.2 at cathodic potentials. Negligible cathodic activity in the absence of NO 3 − indicates high selectivity with respect to non-nitrate reduction processes. In situ photoemission data indicate that nitrate adsorption and reduction to adsorbed NO 2 is a key step in the reduction process. NO 3 RR activity is also observed at pH 7, albeit at a much slower rate. The results indicate that in","au":["Qasim Adesope","Mohammad K. Altafi","Stella C. Amagbor","Kabirat Balogun","Manan Guragain","Alankar Kafle"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate to Ammonia"],"zt":"在氧化钒表面 V(3 + ) 和 V(4 + ) 氧化态下硝酸电催化还原为氨","zb":"电化学还原硝酸为氨对农业和能源应用以及地下水净化具有重要意义。报道原位光电子数据、电化学结果和密度泛函理论计算，表明由 V 金属环境暴露制备的氧化钒（具有 V3+ 和 V4+ 氧化态分布）在 pH 3.2 的阴极电位下特异性吸附并还原硝酸为氨。在缺乏 NO3 − 时阴极活性可忽略，表明对非硝酸还原过程具有高选择性。原位光电子数据表明硝酸吸附和还原为吸附的 NO2 是还原过程中的关键步骤。pH 7 下也观察到 NO3 RR 活性，但速率慢得多。结果表明中间态（非 d0）氧化态对分子氮和硝酸还原为氨均很重要。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.nanolett.4c00576","t":"Direct Eight-Electron N 2 O Electroreduction to NH 3 Enabled by an Fe Double-Atom Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.nanolett.4c00576","s":"Nano Letters","d":"2024-07-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"N2O is a dominant atmosphere pollutant, causing ozone depletion and global warming. Currently, electrochemical reduction of N2O has gained increasing attention to remove N2O, but its product is worthless N2. Here, we propose a direct eight-electron (8e) pathway to electrochemically convert N2O into NH3. As a proof of concept, using density functional theory calculation, an Fe2 double-atom catalyst (DAC) anchored by N-doped porous graphene (Fe2@NG) was screened out to be the most active and selective catalyst for N2O electroreduction toward NH3 via the novel 8e pathway, which benefits from the unique bent N2O adsorption configuration. Guided by theoretical prediction, Fe2@NG DAC was fabricated experimentally, and it can achieve a high N2O-to-NH3 Faradaic efficiency of 77.8% with a large NH3 yield rate of 2.9 mg h-1 cm-2 at -0.6 V vs RHE in a neutral electrolyte. Our study offers a feasibl","au":["Donghai Wu","Kai Chen","Peng Lv","Ziyu Ma","Ke Chu","Dongwei Ma"],"o":"回填","why":["reduction of N2"],"zt":"直接八电子 N2O 电化学还原为 NH3 由 Fe 双原子催化剂实现","zb":"N2O 是主要的空气污染物，导致臭氧层损耗和全球变暖。电化学还原 N2O 获得关注以去除 N2O，但产物是无用的 N2。提出直接八电子 (8e) 路径电化学将 N2O 转化为 NH3。使用密度泛函理论计算，筛选出 N-掺杂多孔石墨烯 (Fe2@NG) 锚定的 Fe2 双原子催化剂 (DAC) 作为 N2O 电化学还原 NH3 的最活跃和选择性催化剂，这得益于独特的弯曲 N2O 吸附构型。根据理论预测，实验制备 Fe2@NG DAC，在 -0.6 V vs RHE 中中性电解质中实现 77.8% 的 N2O 至 NH3 法拉第效率，NH3 产率率为 2.9 mg h-1 cm-2。研究提供从污染物 N2O 合成 NH3 的可行策略，同时去除 N2O。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.rser.2024.114517","t":"Green ammonia production using current and emerging electrolysis technologies","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.rser.2024.114517","s":"Renewable and Sustainable Energy Reviews","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"This study investigates utilizing hydrogen produced via water electrolysis to produce green ammonia. Routes are benchmarked based on employing either alkaline electrolysis (AEC) or solid oxide electrolysis (SOEC). Both existing and possible improvements are modeled for the AEC and SOEC technologies coupled with the Haber-Bosch process to synthesize ammonia. The cost of green ammonia is estimated considering the cost of electrolyzers for both today and future projections and are compared with that of \"fossil\" ammonia synthesized from natural gas. Threshold CO2 taxes required to achieve cost parity between green and \"fossil\" ammonia are determined based on the price of natural gas and the levelized cost of electricity. It is found that whereas the green ammonia produced from a system based on AEC is cheaper today, SOEC shows to be more cost-effective, when basing the comparison on the proj","au":["Hossein Nami","Peter Vang Hendriksen","Henrik Lund Frandsen"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"利用当前和新兴电解技术生产绿色氨","zb":"本研究调查利用水电解产生的氢气来生产绿色氨。基于使用碱性电解 (AEC) 或固体氧化物电解 (SOEC) 对路线进行基准测试。对与哈伯-博施工艺耦合的 AEC 和 SOEC 技术的现有和可能改进的方案进行了建模，以合成氨。估计了绿色氨的成本，考虑了今天和未来预测的电解器的成本，并与从天然气合成的“化石”氨的成本进行了比较。基于天然气价格和电力平准化成本，确定了实现绿色氨和“化石”氨成本平价的所需 CO2 税收门槛。研究发现，基于 AEC 的系统今天生产的绿色氨更便宜，而 SOEC 在基于电解器未来成本的比较中显示出更高的成本效益。预计到 2050 年，基于 SOEC 的氨厂生产的绿色氨成本为 495 €/t，假设电力价格为 30 €/MWh。在基于 SOEC 的氨厂中，对于低压和高压电解器，分别有大约 57 % 和 31 % 的电解器所需的蒸汽可以通过电解器和哈伯-博施工艺之间的热集成来产","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1016/j.mcat.2024.114280","t":"Heterostructure design on honeycomb borophene/Mo2C: A novel strategy for nitrogen fixation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mcat.2024.114280","s":"Molecular Catalysis","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Tian Gao","Manqi Li","Domoina Holiharimanana","Zhenhua Liu","Zhao Wang","Hao Sun"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"蜂窝状硼烯/Mo2C 异质结构设计","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.conengprac.2024.105946","t":"Nonlinear model predictive control of flexible ammonia production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.conengprac.2024.105946","s":"Control Engineering Practice","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Flexible dynamic operation of ammonia synthesis is a key enabling factor of green ammonia production in the face of intermittency in renewable energy sources. A nonlinear model predictive control scheme is presented in this paper for the Haber-Bosch ammonia synthesis process with a varying feed flowrate. The considered process consists of three interstage-cooled reactor beds and a flash separator, with a flexible reactor load varying between 50% and 100% of its nominal capacity. The proposed control scheme aims to control the reactor temperatures, separation pressure, and the liquid volume in the flash tank during feed transitions. A simulation study is performed given an assumed 5-hour feed schedule. The results indicate that all controlled variables are maintained in a safe operating range and tracked with small o ff sets in the nominal case as well as under disturbances in the reactio","au":["Baiwen Kong","Qi Zhang","Prodromos Daoutidis"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"柔性氨生产的非线性模型预测控制","zb":"针对可再生能源间歇性导致的进料流量变化，提出一种用于哈伯-博施氨合成过程的非线性模型预测控制（NMPC）方案。模拟显示，在进料负载 50%–100% 变化下，NMPC 能在约 10 分钟内使反应器温度稳定，相比 PID 控制器响应更快且振荡更小。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1016/j.matlet.2024.136577","t":"Rapid heating synthesis of ultrafine PtCo nanoparticles anchored on carbon nanofibers as high-performance bifunctional oxygen electrocatalysts for zinc-air batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matlet.2024.136577","s":"Materials Letters","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Cheng Qu","Peng Dai","Xinxin Yu","Lixin Zhang","Mingzai Wu"],"o":"回填","why":["Rapid heating"],"zt":"快速加热合成的超细 PtCo 纳米颗粒锚定在碳纳米纤维上作为高性能双功能氧电催化剂用于锌空气电池","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.matchemphys.2024.129421","t":"Flash sintering of ZrO2–SnO2–ZrSnO4 composite nanofibers: Fabrication, properties, and biochemical effects in Drosophila melanogaster","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matchemphys.2024.129421","s":"Materials Chemistry and Physics","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:23:23Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Eda Güneş","Zeynep Çetinkaya"],"o":"回填","why":["Flash sintering"],"zt":"ZrO2–SnO2–ZrSnO4 复合纳米纤维的闪光烧结：制备、性质和在 Drosophila melanogaster 中的生化效应","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jeurceramsoc.2024.01.077","t":"Efficient synthesis and densification of MgAl2O4 ceramics: Combining reactive cold sintering with ultrafast high-temperature sintering","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jeurceramsoc.2024.01.077","s":"Journal of the European Ceramic Society","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Hui-Zhen Shen","Rui-Fen Guo","Ping Shen"],"o":"回填","why":["ultrafast high-temperature sintering"],"zt":"MgAl2O4 陶瓷的高效合成和致密化：结合反应冷烧结与超高温快速烧结","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.inoche.2024.112466","t":"Synthesis, physico-chemical properties, and AC induction heating of polycaprolactone-coated bio-compatible Fe3O4 nanoparticles","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.inoche.2024.112466","s":"Inorganic Chemistry Communications","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["K. Rekha","R. Ezhil Vizhi","B.B. Lahiri","John Philip"],"o":"回填","why":["induction heating"],"zt":"聚己内酯包覆的生物相容性 Fe3O4 纳米颗粒的合成、物理化学性质和交流感应加热","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijoes.2024.100585","t":"Enhanced carbon monoxide tolerance of platinum nanoparticles synthesized through the Flash Joule Heating Method","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijoes.2024.100585","s":"International Journal of Electrochemical Science","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Was employ the Flash Joule Heating Method (FJHM) to synthesize carbon-supported Pt nanoparticles. In this method, an aqueous solution of the Pt precursorH2PtCl6·6H2O is introduced into a reactor containing Vulcan XC 72 carbon. Subsequently, the mixture undergoes 50 cycles of discharges at 100 coulombs per discharge. Comparative XRD analysis with a commercially prepared Pt/C BASF, utilizing a reduction deposition method, reveals an expansion in the interplanar spacing of the platinum crystal lattice in the FJHM-prepared Pt/C catalyst (FJHM-Pt/C). This expansion suggests the emergence of structural defects, a finding confirmed by TEM images displaying distinct step-like features on the FJHM-Pt/C surface. Cyclic voltammogram analysis demonstrates a noteworthy increase in the oxidation pre-peak at 0.5 V for FJHM-Pt/C compared to Pt/C BASF. When employing pure H2 as fuel, the single proton ex","au":["Julio Nandenha","Gabriel Silvestrin","Larissa Otubo","Delvonei A. Andrade","Rodrigo F.B. de Souza","Ermete Antolini"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"通过闪光焦耳加热法制备的铂纳米颗粒的碳 monoxide 耐受性增强","zb":"采用闪蒸焦耳加热法在碳载体上合成铂纳米颗粒，发现该方法制备的催化剂晶格间距增大且表面存在台阶状缺陷。在纯氢燃料中功率密度较低，但在含CO环境中，该催化剂在质子交换膜燃料电池中表现出更高的最大功率密度，显著提升了一氧化碳耐受性。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2024.131659","t":"Magnetic induction heating-assisted synthesis of biodiesel using an alumina/iron oxide nanocatalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2024.131659","s":"Fuel","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"While generating biodiesel from vegetable oils presents various advantages over fossil fuels, ongoing actions aim to improve the efficiency of this production process. Emphasis is placed on optimizing experimental conditions, including the catalyst selection, reaction media and the energy source for heating and mixing, thereby revealing existing research gaps in biodiesel production. In this sense, we have designed a magnetic nanocatalyst based on iron oxide nanoparticles (IONPs) of 18 nm in diameter incorporated within an alumina matrix of around 500 nm infused with potassium hydroxide that provides the catalyst's mesoporosity and basicity. Magnetization analyses confirmed the superparamagnetic behaviour of the nanocatalyst at room temperature and a saturation magnetisation high enough to ease magnetic recovery for reuse. Additionally, magnetic nanoparticles can serve as nanoheaters whe","au":["Belén Corrales-Pérez","Gemma Vicente","María del Puerto Morales","Alvaro Gallo-Cordova"],"o":"回填","why":["induction heating"],"zt":"磁感应加热辅助的生物质柴油合成使用氧化铝/氧化铁纳米催化剂","zb":"设计了一种基于18 nm氧化铁纳米颗粒的氧化铝基磁性纳米催化剂，利用交变磁场下的磁感应加热实现高效合成。在100 kHz和48 kA/m条件下，该催化剂在65 °C下将生物柴油转化率提升至98.6%，产率达95.6%，并具备优异的磁分离回收性能。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2024.151875","t":"Enhanced ammonia-cracking process via induction heating for green hydrogen: A comprehensive energy, exergy, economic, and environmental (4E) analysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2024.151875","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Seunggwan Yun","Junhyeok Im","Junhwan Kim","Hyungtae Cho","Jaewon Lee"],"o":"回填","why":["induction heating"],"zt":"通过感应加热增强氨裂解过程用于绿色氢：综合能源、火用、经济和环境 (4E) 分析","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2024.160099","t":"Area-selective atomic layer deposition of Ru thin films by chemo-selective inhibition of alkyl aldehyde molecules on nitride surfaces","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2024.160099","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Jinseon Lee","Jieun Oh","Jiwon Kim","Hongjun Oh","Bonggeun Shong","Woo-Hee Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过氮化物表面烷基醛分子的化学选择性抑制实现面积选择性原子层沉积 Ru 薄膜","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/admi.202400270","t":"Atomic Layer Deposition of Molybdenum Carbide Thin Films","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/admi.202400270","s":"Advanced Materials Interfaces","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract The development of deposition processes for metal carbide thin films is rapidly advancing, driven by their potential for applications including catalysis, batteries, and semiconductor devices. Within this landscape, atomic layer deposition (ALD) offers exceptional conformality, uniformity, and thickness control on spatially complex structures. This paper presents a comprehensive study on the thermal ALD of MoC x with MoCl 5 and 1,4‐bis(trimethylgermyl)‐1,4‐dihydropyrazine [(Me 3 Ge) 2 DHP] as precursors, focusing on the functional properties and characterization of the films. The depositions are conducted at 200–300 °C and very smooth films with RMS Rq ≈0.3–0.6 nm on Si, TiN, and HfO 2 substrates are obtained. The process has a high growth rate of 1.5 Å cycle −1 and the films appear to be continuous already after 5 cycles. The films are conductive even at thicknesses below 5 nm,","au":["Paloma Ruiz Kärkkäinen","Georgi Popov","Timo Hatanpää","Antti Kemppinen","Katja Kohopää","Mohammad Bagheri"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积钼碳化物薄膜","zb":"金属碳化物薄膜沉积工艺的发展迅速，得益于其在催化、电池和半导体器件等领域的应用潜力。原子层沉积 (ALD) 提供了在空间复杂结构上卓越的共形性、均匀性和厚度控制。本研究全面研究了 200–300 °C 下使用 MoCl 5 和 1,4‐双(三甲基硅基)‐1,4‐二氢吡嗪 [(Me 3 Si) 2 DHP] 作为前驱体的 MoC x 的热 ALD，重点研究了薄膜的功能特性和表征。沉积在 Si、TiN 和 HfO 2 基板上获得非常光滑的薄膜，RMS Rq ≈0.3–0.6 nm。该工艺具有 1.5 Å 循环 −1 的高生长速率，薄膜在 5 个循环后已连续。薄膜在厚度低于 5 nm 时仍导电，18 nm 以上的薄膜在 4.4 K 以下表现出超导性。计算了钼碳化物和氮化物的拉曼模式，并使用 X 射线衍射和 X 射线光电子能谱进行相分析。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jallcom.2024.174489","t":"Preparation of a Novel Znfe2o4 /Oyster Shell Powder Composite Photocatalyst for Visible-Light-Driven Photocatalytic Degradation of Ammonia Nitrogen Wastewater","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jallcom.2024.174489","s":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xianyong Guo","Fan Gao","Guangjing Xu","Haiyan Liu","Wenchao Teng","Cuiya Zhang"],"o":"回填","zt":"用于可见光催化降解氨氮废水的 ZnFe2O4 /牡蛎壳粉复合光催化剂的制备","ob":"光驱动","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.susc.2024.122483","t":"A comparative theoretical study of the mechanism of ammonia decomposition on various Co/Ni catalysts using density functional theory","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.susc.2024.122483","s":"Surface Science","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Endi Huangluo","Haiqiao Wei","Ying Wang","Lei Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"使用密度泛函理论对不同 Co/Ni 催化剂的氨分解机理的比较理论研究","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2024.126745","t":"CuPc decorating NiO for efficient photoelectrochemical ammonia production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2024.126745","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Hongye Bai","Meiqi Zhai","Lijing Liu","Donghui Shao","Fagen Wang","Weiqiang Fan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"CuPc 装饰 NiO 用于高效的光电化学氨生产","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.nxener.2024.100144","t":"Protonic ceramic electrochemical cells: Opportunities and challenges for ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nxener.2024.100144","s":"Next Energy","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical ammonia synthesis is being widely investigated to couple with renewable electricity for future sustainable ammonia production. Protonic ceramic electrochemical cells (PCECs) possess superior energy transfer efficiency and remarkable flexibility to produce high-demand chemicals such as H 2 , CH 4 , and NH 3 from readily available feedstocks (e.g., H 2 O, CO 2 , N 2 ). Despite recent advances that have been established, the research for the high-efficiency PCECs for practical ammonia synthesis continues. In this review, we summarized the recent progress of PCECs for ammonia synthesis. First, we briefly introduce the basic mechanisms and protocols of the ammonia synthesis. Then, we systemically introduce the cell configurations, representative electrolytes and electrodes of PCECs for the ammonia synthesis. We highlight the strategies to tune the ion/ electron mobility and th","au":["Qinyi Hu","Chuan Tian","Di Bao","Haixia Zhong","Xinbo Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"质子陶瓷电化学电池：氨合成中的机遇和挑战","zb":"电化学氨合成正在被广泛研究，以与可再生能源结合，为未来的可持续氨生产提供支持。质子陶瓷电化学电池 (PCECs) 具有卓越的能量传输效率和显著的灵活性，可以从易得的原料（例如 H2O、CO2、N2）生产高需求化学品，如 H2、CH4 和 NH3。尽管近年来已取得了一些进展，但针对实际氨合成的 PCECs 的高效研究仍在继续。在本综述中，我们总结了 PCECs 用于氨合成的最新进展。首先，我们简要介绍了氨合成的基本机制和协议。然后，我们系统地介绍了 PCECs 用于氨合成的电池配置、代表性电解质和电极。我们强调了调节离子/电子迁移率和催化性能的策略，这些策略与电解质/电极的缺陷结构和氧化还原特性有关，以及下一代氨合成的机遇。最后，提出了 PCECs 中氨合成的展望，考虑了当前的挑战。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.nxener.2024.100125","t":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia using copper-based electrocatalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nxener.2024.100125","s":"Next Energy","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia (NH3) is an ideal green fuel with high energy density and plays an indispensable role in fertilizer production. Electrochemical reduction of nitrate (NO3–), a toxic pollutant in groundwater, has shown promising as a viable approach to converting waste into valuable NH3 under ambient conditions, offering an alternative to the energy-intensive Haber-Bosch process. Due to their high efficiency, copper (Cu)-based materials have shown great potential as electrocatalysts for the NO3– reduction reaction (NO3–RR) to NH3. In this review, we provide a comprehensive summary of the fundamental principles underlying nitrate reduction over Cu-based electrocatalysts and discuss various strategies to enhance the performance of NO3– reduction, including facets, morphologies, size, surface functionalization, compositional engineering, and defect engineering. We also delve into the relationship bet","au":["Rong Zhang","Shaoce Zhang","Huilin Cui","Ying Guo","Nan Li","Chunyi Zhi"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"使用铜基电催化剂电化学硝酸还原为氨","zb":"氨 (NH3) 是一种理想的绿色燃料，具有高能量密度，在肥料生产中发挥着不可或缺的作用。电化学还原硝酸 (NO3–)，地下水中的有毒污染物，已显示出在环境条件下将废物转化为有价值的 NH3 的潜力，为能耗高的哈伯-博施过程提供了一种替代方案。由于效率高，铜 (Cu) 基材料已显示出作为 NO3– 还原反应 (NO3–RR) 到 NH3 的电催化剂的巨大潜力。在本综述中，我们全面总结了 Cu 基电催化剂上硝酸还原的基本原理，并讨论了各种提高 NO3– 还原性能的策略，包括晶面、形貌、尺寸、表面官能化、组分工程和缺陷工程。我们还深入研究了电催化剂的电催化性能与结构特征之间的关系，并彻底检查了 NO3–RR 中涉及的反应机理。此外，我们强调了该研究领域面临的现有挑战和未来的发展前景。本综述为 Cu 基电催化剂的战略设计和优化提供了宝贵的见解和指导。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.mssp.2024.108368","t":"One-dimensional biomass-based carbon nanotubes loaded with MoS2 as catalysts for the electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mssp.2024.108368","s":"Materials Science in Semiconductor Processing","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Shengyan Wang","Jiansheng Tian","Abulikemu Abulizi","Kenji Okitsu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"一维生物质基碳纳米管负载 MoS2 作为电催化氮还原反应的催化剂","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mattod.2024.05.007","t":"Conformal surface intensive doping of low-valence Bi on Cu2O for highly efficient electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mattod.2024.05.007","s":"Materials Today","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Thi Kim Cuong Phu","Won Tae Hong","Hyungu Han","Young In Song","Jong Hun Kim","Seung Hun Roh"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"在 Cu2O 上进行低价态 Bi 的 conformal 表面密集掺杂用于高效电化学硝酸还原为氨生产","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2024.234644","t":"Highly selective and stable electrochemical reduction of nitrate to ammonia using VO2-x/CuF catalyst with oxygen vacancies","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2024.234644","s":"Journal of Power Sources","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Sajid Mahmood","Anum Bilal","Muhammad Ammar","Shahid Khan","Noshin Afshan","Osamah Alduhaish"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"使用 VO2-x/CuF 催化剂和氧空位的硝酸高选择性和稳定电化学还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2024.234621","t":"The intermediate valence state Mo5+ in Fe doping La2(MoO4)3 boosting electrochemical nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2024.234621","s":"Journal of Power Sources","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Liangqing Hu","Yanming Guo","Yinpeng Lu","Jin Chang","Xiaojiang Su","Xinyi Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["electrochemical nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"Fe 掺杂 La2(MoO4)3 中间价态 Mo5+ 促进电化学氮还原","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jhazmat.2024.134522","t":"Pulsed electro-catalysis enables effective conversion of low-concentration nitrate to ammonia over Cu2O@Pd tandem catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jhazmat.2024.134522","s":"Journal of Hazardous Materials","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electro-catalytic conversion of nitrate (NO3-) to ammonia (NH3) via the Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia (NORA) process represents a promising strategy for both ammonia synthesis and environmental remediation. Despite its potential, the efficiency of low-concentration NORA is often hindered by mass transfer limitations, competing byproducts (N2 and NO2-), and side reactions such as hydrogen evolution. This study introduces a novel pulsed electro-synthesis technique that alternates the potential to periodically accumulate and transform NO2- intermediates near a Cu2O@Pd electrode, enhancing the NORA process. Compared with that under potentiostatic conditions, the Cu2O@Pd electrodes exhibited a higher NORA activity under the optimized pulsed condition, where a NH3-N Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 81.2%, a yield rate of 1.08 mg h-1 cm-2 and a selectivity efficiency (SE) of 81.5%, were achieved. In-","au":["Fei Dou","Fengchen Guo","Bo Li","Kai Zhang","Nigel Graham","Wenzheng Yu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"析氢反应"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2024.06.128","t":"The dual-transition-metal dichalcogenide monolayers anchored with Mn dimer: Promising electrocatalysts for efficient nitrogen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2024.06.128","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Fengjuan Guo","Junwei Ma","Xiaoyan Deng","Hongtao Gao"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2024.06.041","t":"Power-to-ammonia synthesis process with membrane reactors: Techno- economic study","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2024.06.041","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This work aims at investigating the potential of catalytic membrane reactors (CMRs) for ammonia production from renewable hydrogen. To achieve this objective, computer-aided process simulation is deployed using Aspen plus v14 simulation tool. A 1D model is developed to describe the integration of a ruthenium catalyst into a CMR equipped with inorganic membranes that are selective to NH 3 over N 2 and H 2 . First, the CMR performance is studied across a broad spectrum of membrane properties and operating conditions. Subsequently, the CMR model is integrated into several Power-to-Ammonia (PtA) process layouts, which are optimized and techno-economically compared against a traditional PEM-based PtA production process, employing condensation for the purification stage. Key findings at the reactor level confirmed that beyond a selectivity threshold towards hydrogen of 10–20, both the degree o","au":["Simon Richard","Vito Verde","Nouaamane Kezibri","Camel Makhloufi","Assia Saker","Iolanda Gargiulo"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨；涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2024.06.038","t":"Screening WS2−based single−atom catalysts for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2024.06.038","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mamutjan Tursun","Abdukader Abdukayum","Chao Wu","Caihong Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2024.06.024","t":"Efficient electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate to ammonia using Cu–CeO2 solid solution","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2024.06.024","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Hongliang Dai","Lijing Liu","Huaiquan Zhao","Pengjie Zhou","Yulong Ying","Mengyang Yin"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2024.131686","t":"Activating the synergistic effect in Ni-Co bimetallic MOF for enhanced plasma-assisted ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2024.131686","s":"Fuel","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yuhang Jing","Feng Gong","Sijun Wang","Wenbin Wang","Peng Yang","Enkang Fu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2024.131543","t":"Highly active and stable Ni@SiO2 catalyst for ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2024.131543","s":"Fuel","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Shigang Li","Xiaohui Liu","Yong Guo","Yanqin Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"高活性稳定的 Ni@SiO2 催化剂用于氨分解","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2024.131489","t":"Industrial waste-based Ni-catalysts for ammonia decomposition to produce clean hydrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2024.131489","s":"Fuel","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Omar M. AlAmoudi","Wasim Ullah Khan","Dwi Hantoko","Syed A. Ali","Mohammad M. Hossain"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"基于工业废物的 Ni 催化剂用于氨分解产生清洁氢气","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ese.2023.100383","t":"Copper-based electro-catalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia from water: Mechanism, preparation, and research directions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ese.2023.100383","s":"Environmental Science and Ecotechnology","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Global water bodies are increasingly imperiled by nitrate pollution, primarily originating from industrial waste, agricultural runoffs, and urban sewage. This escalating environmental crisis challenges traditional water treatment paradigms and necessitates innovative solutions. Electro-catalysis, especially utilizing copper-based catalysts, known for their efficiency, cost-effectiveness, and eco-friendliness, offer a promising avenue for the electro-catalytic reduction of nitrate to ammonia. In this review, we systematically consolidate current research on diverse copper-based catalysts, including pure Cu, Cu alloys, oxides, single-atom entities, and composites. Furthermore, we assess their catalytic performance, operational mechanisms, and future research directions to find effective, long-term solutions to water purification and ammonia synthesis. Electro-catalysis technology shows the","au":["Jinshan Wei","Yi Li","Hexing Lin","Xihui Lu","Chucheng Zhou","Ya-yun Li"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于铜的电催化硝酸盐还原为氨从水：机理、制备和研究方向","zb":"全球水体日益受到硝酸盐污染，主要源于工业废物、农业径流和城市污水。电催化，特别是利用铜基催化剂，因其效率、成本效益和环保性，为电催化硝酸盐还原为氨提供了有前景的途径。该综述系统地整合了当前关于各种铜基催化剂的研究，包括纯 Cu、Cu 合金、氧化物、单原子实体和复合材料。此外，评估了它们的催化性能、操作机制和未来研究方向，以寻找有效、长期的解决方案。电催化技术在水净化和氨合成方面显示出缓解硝酸盐污染的潜力，并在可持续环境管理中具有战略重要性。在应用方面，关于真实水体的复杂性、商业催化剂的规模化以及产生的 NH3 的高效收集等挑战仍然存在。研究特别提出了关于催化剂的长期稳定性和原位机制的后续研究。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.enconman.2024.118429","t":"A novel combination of machine learning and intelligent optimization algorithm for modeling and optimization of green ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.enconman.2024.118429","s":"Energy Conversion and Management","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Zhihua Deng","Lan Zhang","Bin Miao","Qinglin Liu","Zehua Pan","Weike Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"机器学习和智能优化算法的组合用于绿色氨合成的建模和优化","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.electacta.2024.144415","t":"Membrane/electrolyte interplay on ammonia motion inside a flow-cell for electrochemical nitrogen and nitrate reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.electacta.2024.144415","s":"Electrochimica Acta","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical ammonia production from molecular nitrogen and nitrate reduction reactions at ambient conditions has gained a lot of attention in recent years, making this topic more and more appealing. The race towards good and quick results in terms of Faradaic efficiency and productivity is not always focused on the possible source of ammonia contamination. In particular, Nafion membrane is the most commonly used in this field as cell separator, discarding the possible known disadvantages coming from ammonium ions absorption and release. The wettable microporous Celgard membrane has been proposed as a substitute for Nafion membranes, despite the separation mechanism, in this case, is only dimension-driven, so it does not assure ammonium ions retention. This paper reveals that the mechanism of ammonium ions absorption and release by Nafion 117 is strongly related to the cations present","au":["Noemi Pirrone","Sara Garcia-Ballesteros","Simelys Hernández","Federico Bella"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"膜/电解质相互作用对流池中氨的运动影响电化学氮和硝酸盐还原","zb":"电化学氨生产从分子氮和硝酸盐还原反应在环境条件下已引起近年来广泛关注。该研究探讨了 Nafion 膜和湿可渗透微孔 Celgard 膜作为电池隔膜时对铵离子吸收和释放的影响。研究发现 Nafion 117 膜的铵离子吸收和释放机制与电解质中阳离子密切相关，而 Celgard 膜则无显著铵离子吸收。电化学氮和硝酸盐还原测试表明 Nafion 膜对铵离子产量有显著影响，尤其是在低产量情况下。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.electacta.2024.144348","t":"Support effect in metal–organic framework-derived copper-based electrocatalysts facilitating the reduction of nitrate to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.electacta.2024.144348","s":"Electrochimica Acta","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Shang-Cheng Yang","Balaganesh Muthiah","Jhe-Wei Chang","Meng-Dian Tsai","Yi-Ching Wang","Yi-Pei Li"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"金属有机框架衍生的铜基电催化剂中载体效应促进硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.checat.2024.101054","t":"A balance of electron and proton accessibility for ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.checat.2024.101054","s":"Chem Catalysis","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Tao Zhang","Hong Jin Fan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"zt":"电子和质子可及性的平衡用于氨电合成","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cattod.2024.114774","t":"Preparation of Co/SiC catalyst and its catalytic activity for ammonia decomposition to produce hydrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cattod.2024.114774","s":"Catalysis Today","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Rongji Xu","Fengxiang Yin","Jie Zhang","Guoru Li","Gideon Kofie","Yuhang Tan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"Co/SiC 催化剂的制备及其用于氨分解产生氢的催化活性","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2024.123862","t":"Molten salts etching strategy construct alloy/MXene heterostructures for efficient ammonia synthesis and energy supply via Zn-nitrite battery","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2024.123862","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Zhijie Cui","Pengwei Zhao","Honghai Wang","Chunli Li","Wenchao Peng","Xiaobin Fan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"熔盐蚀刻策略构建合金/MXene 异质结构用于高效的氨合成和 Zn-亚硝酸电池能源供应","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2024.123836","t":"Solar driven ammonia synthesis with Co-TiOx and Ag nanowires enhanced Cu2ZnSnS4 photocathodes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2024.123836","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Restoring ammonia from waste nitrate stands as a promising strategy for reducing reliance on the energy-intensive Haber-Bosch process and tackling environmental pollutants. Advancing the catalytic aspects of photoelectrochemical (PEC) ammonia synthesis via waste nitrate reduction is of great importance to enhance its viability for sustainable chemical production. However, this process still suffers from low ammonia faradaic efficiency (FE) with high operational potential due to its involvement in multi-electron reactions. Herein, we integrated a cobalt-doped TiO x (Co-TiO x ) cocatalyst and Ag nanowires (NWs) electron extraction layer onto TiO x /CdS/Cu 2 ZnSnS 4 (CZTS) photocathode, achieving nearly 100 % ammonia FE and an onset potential of ∼0.49 V vs. RHE. Evidenced by the in-situ synchrotron-radiated FTIR (SR-FTIR) and theoretical calculations, the increased ratio of surface oxygen v","au":["Shujie Zhou","Kaiwen Sun","Cui Ying Toe","Jialiang Huang","Ao Wang","Jodie Yuwono"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"太阳能驱动的氨合成：Co-TiOx 和 Ag 纳米线增强的 Cu2ZnSnS4 光阴极","zb":"研究对象为 TiO x /CdS/Cu 2 ZnSnS 4 (CZTS) 光阴极，采用 Co-TiO x 共催化剂和 Ag 纳米线电子提取层，通过光电化学 (PEC) 氨合成从废硝酸中还原氨，关键方法为制备 Co-TiO x 和 Ag 纳米线增强的 CZTS 光阴极，主要结果为氨法拉第效率接近 100%，起始电位约为 0.49 V vs. RHE，Co-TiO x 增加表面氧空位位点 (Vo) 有助于关键反应中间体吸附 (*NO 3 和 *NO 2 )，Ag 纳米线促进电子从 TiO x /CdS/CZTS 提取到催化位点。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2024.123810","t":"Enhancing nitrate reduction to ammonia by synergistic and interface coupling effects of binary metal sites","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2024.123810","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Qiao Gou","Yini Mao","Shengmei Lv","Fenglin Gou","Yimin Jiang","Wei Shen"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"通过二元金属位点的协同和界面耦合效应增强硝酸还原为氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202470225","t":"Deciphering Indirect Nitrite Reduction to Ammonia in High‐Entropy Electrocatalysts Using In Situ Raman and X‐ray Absorption Spectroscopies (Small 29/2024)","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202470225","s":"Small","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Emulsion Separation Pulsed laser irradiation in liquids approach employed to transform high-entropy FeCoNiCuMn Prussian blue analogs into a single-phase spinel high-entropy oxide and fcc high-entropy alloy (HEA). HEA exhibits remarkable attributes, including high conductivity, a reactive surface, and exceptional performance in capturing and converting low-level nitrite into ammonia with impressive efficiency and selectivity. Indirect nitrite reduction mechanistic steps occurred via surface reactive intermediates, captured using in situ electrochemical–Raman and X-ray absorption spectroscopy. More in article number 2400538, Myong Yong Choi and co-workers.","au":["Talshyn Begildayeva","Jayaraman Theerthagiri","Wanwisa Limphirat","Ahreum Min","Soorathep Kheawhom","Myong Yong Choi"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrite Reduction"],"zt":"使用原位拉曼和 X 射线吸收光谱解析高熵电催化剂中间接亚硝酸还原为氨","zb":"采用乳液分离脉冲激光照射在液体中方法将高熵 FeCoNiCuMn 蓝钴矿类似物转化为单相尖晶石高熵氧化物和 fcc 高熵合金 (HEA)。HEA 具有显著特性，包括高电导率、反应性表面和捕获并转化低水平亚硝酸盐为氨的优异性能和选择性和效率。间接亚硝酸还原机理步骤通过表面反应中间体发生，使用原位电化学-拉曼和 X 射线吸收光谱捕获。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adts.202400536","t":"Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction Reaction from Ab Initio Thermodynamics: Single versus Dual Atom Catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adts.202400536","s":"Advanced Theory and Simulations","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) is a key process for the energy transition. Transition metal atoms atomically dispersed on a solid support represent a promising approach to the design of new catalytic materials. The interest for single‐ (SACs) and dual‐atom catalysts (DACs) is steadily growing. In general, DACs are considered more active than SACs for NRR. In this work, the complex chemistry behind NRR is investigated on a set of SACs and DACs by means of density functional theory (DFT) calculations. The results indicate that self‐interaction corrected exchange‐correlation functionals must be adopted, at variance with several studies in the literature. Furthermore, it is not possible to extrapolate results obtained on conventional extended catalytic surfaces to SACs and DACs, due to a richer scenario of possible reaction paths. In general, the results show ","au":["Ilaria Barlocco","Matteo Spotti","Giovanni Di Liberto","Gianfranco Pacchioni"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrogen Reduction Reaction"],"ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.susmat.2024.e00917","t":"Insights into the state-of-the-art developments in active-sites engineering for electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate (NO3−) to green ammonia (NH3)","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.susmat.2024.e00917","s":"Sustainable Materials and Technologies","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Thi Hong Chuong Nguyen","Cong Hong Nhat Nguyen","Trung Hieu Le","Pardeep Singh","Pankaj Raizada","Sakar Mohan"],"o":"回填","zt":"关于活性位点工程在硝酸 (NO3−) 电催化还原为绿色氨 (NH3) 方面的最新进展的见解","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.bios.2024.116254","t":"Light-driven, bias-free nitrogenase-based bioelectrochemical cell for ammonia generation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.bios.2024.116254","s":"Biosensors and Bioelectronics","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Nitrogen fixation is a key process that sustains life on Earth. Nitrogenase is the sole enzyme capable of fixing nitrogen under ambient conditions. Extensive research efforts have been dedicated to elucidating the enzyme mechanism and its artificial activation through high applied voltage, photochemistry, or strong reducing agents. Harnessing light irradiation to minimize the required external bias can lower the process's high energy investment. Herein, we present the development of photo-bioelectrochemical cells (PBECs) utilizing BiVO4/CoP or CdS/NiO photoanodes for nitrogenase activation toward N2 fixation. The constructed PBEC based on BiVO4/CoP photoanode requires minimal external bias (200 mV) and suppresses O2 generation that allows efficient activation of the nitrogenase enzyme, using glucose as an electron donor. In a second developed PBEC configuration, CdS/NiO photoanode was us","au":["Matan M. Meirovich","Oren Bachar","Mor Shemesh","Yifat Cohen","Alice Popik","Omer Yehezkeli"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"光驱动、无偏压的氮酶基生物电化学电池用于氨生成","zb":"研究对象为 BiVO4/CoP 或 CdS/NiO 光阳极，关键方法为构建光生物电化学细胞 (PBEC) 激活氮酶进行 N2 固定，主要结果为基于 BiVO4/CoP 光阳极的 PBEC 仅需 200 mV 外部偏压，抑制 O2 生成，利用葡萄糖作为电子供体，激活氮酶酶，CdS/NiO 光阳极的 PBEC 实现无偏压激活，产氨 100 μM，法拉第效率 (FE) 为 12%，通过荧光探针和 1H-NMR 光谱验证。","ob":"生物固氮（非气相热催化）；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2024.160006","t":"Plasma-Modification of graphene oxide for advanced ammonia sensing","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2024.160006","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The exceptional tailoriability of electrical properties in reduced graphene oxide (rGO) is a pivotal factor in unleashing its advanced gas sensing capabilities. Amidst various chemically/thermally-driven techniques, plasma reduction emerges as the fastest method with the potential for scalable treatment. This paper demonstrates a controlled plasma-enabled approach for swift and green surface reduction of graphene oxide (GO) films, specifically tailored for room-temperature ammonia (NH3) detection at ppm levels. Employing a mild hydrogen plasma treatment on a thin GO layer deposited on copper electrodes by drop casting, we were able to tailor the sensor’s sensitivity and reversibility due to the great impact of treatment time. The GO reduction experiments were conducted in a low-pressure mild hydrogen plasma discharged at 100 W, and the treatment time varied between 10 and 240 s. Structur","au":["Ardita Kurtishaj Hamzaj","Edoardo Donà","Neelakandan M Santhosh","Vasyl Shvalya","Martin Košiček","Uroš Cvelbar"],"o":"回填","zt":"等离子体改性的氧化石墨烯用于先进的氨传感","zb":"研究对象为还原氧化石墨烯 (rGO)，采用温和的氢等离子体处理 GO 薄膜，关键方法为在铜电极上沉积 GO 薄膜后进行氢等离子体处理，主要结果为处理时间在 10–240 s 范围内，结构化学分析显示氧含量从约 30% 降至 20% 原子百分比，'20 s-rGO' 传感器对 100 ppm 氨的灵敏度最高，为 23.9%，但对 1049 ppm 氨的灵敏度为 47.1%，但恢复时间约为 '240 s-rGO' 的四倍。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及碳材料"},{"id":"10.1007/s12598-024-02679-9","t":"Local environment regulation of transition metal dichalcogenide‐based single‐atom catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s12598-024-02679-9","s":"Rare Metals","d":"2024-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Single‐atom catalysts have risen significant attention in the realm of green electrocatalytic energy conversion to address energy and environmental sustainability challenges. Transition metal dichalcogenide (TMD)‐based single‐atom catalysts are considered highly effective in electrocatalysis due to the TMDs' notable specific surface area, tunable elemental species and efficient utilization of single atoms. In order to enhance electrocatalytic performance, it is imperative to elaborately engineer the local environment surrounding the active sites of single atoms within TMDs. In this review, we initially explore the effects of synthesis methods on single‐atom active sites and the influence of loading of single atoms on catalytic performance for TMDs. The modulation strategies of the local environment surrounding single‐atom sites in TMDs are elaborated, including substitution engi","au":["Ming‐Hui Li","Jing Li","Xiao‐Yu Zheng","Yao Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"过渡金属二硫族化合物基单原子催化剂的局部环境调控","zb":"单原子催化剂在绿色电催化能源转换领域引起显著关注以应对能源和环境可持续性挑战。由于过渡金属二硫族化合物 (TMD) 的显著比表面积、可调元素种类和单原子的高效利用，基于 TMD 的单原子催化剂在电催化中被认为是高效的。为提高电催化性能，必须精心设计 TMD 中单原子活性位点周围的局部环境。本综述首先探讨合成方法对单原子活性位点的影响以及单原子负载对 TMD 催化性能的影响。详细阐述了 TMD 中单原子位点周围局部环境的调制策略，包括取代工程、表面吸附、空位、空间限域和双原子位点策略。对每种调制策略，介绍了不同局部环境对各种电催化应用的影响，如析氧反应、析氧反应、氮还原反应、CO2 还原反应和 CO 氧化。最终，本研究全面概述了基于 TMD 的单原子催化剂在电催化领域面临的挑战和潜在发展方向。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"}]);
